{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Rn2pQr1fo4YBuDZkDYfcVW","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Paper Framing — distill_sparse_swiglu\n2\t\n3\t## Target Venue\n4\t- Primary: EMNLP 2026 Main (ARR May 2026 cycle)\n5\t- Deadline: 2026-05-25 (ARR submission)\n6\t- Track: Efficient Methods for NLP\n7\t\n8\t## Core Claims\n9\t\n10\t1. **KL-trained sparsity predictors eliminate the need for error compensation networks**: At 50% model-level sparsity on SwiGLU LLMs, a KL-trained contextual predictor (no compensation) matches or exceeds BCE+compensation quality (FastForward-style), eliminating ~256MB of inference-time compensation weights and per-layer GEMV overhead. (Headline claim)\n11\t\n12\t2. **Static and contextual corrections compose additively**: SPON's input-independent bias correction (average-case drift) and KL-trained contextual prediction (per-input variation) provide additive quality recovery. Formalized as modular decomposition c = c_s + c_theta(x) where output-space interaction is negligible.\n13\t\n14\t3. **KL advantage scales quadratically with sparsity**: BCE's per-neuron factorized gradient (mean-field analog) misses joint neuron interactions scaling as O(s^2 D^2). Testable prediction: KL-vs-BCE delta follows approximately quadratic curve in sparsity level s.\n15\t\n16\t## Story Spine\n17\t\n18\t- **Problem**: SwiGLU activation sparsity enables 40-60% neuron pruning at inference, but training-free heuristics (WINA/TEAL) leave a 6+ point quality gap, while learned BCE predictors require auxiliary compensation networks adding ~256MB overhead (FastForward).\n19\t\n20\t- **Existing approaches & gaps**: (a) Training-free (WINA, TEAL, R-Sparse): no training cost, but quality gap too large for deployment. (b) Static learned (SPON): zero-overhead bias correction via KL distillation, but input-independent — cannot adapt to per-input neuron importance. (c) Contextual learned (FastForward): BCE predictor + compensation MLP, near-dense quality but inference overhead from compensation network. Gap: no prior work trains the contextual predictor itself with KL, and no work tests SPON + contextual composition.\n21\t\n22\t- **Our framing / headline question**: \"Does output-distribution distillation (KL) make error compensation unnecessary for contextual sparsity prediction?\" The theoretical grounding: BCE gradient dL_BCE/ds_j depends only on neuron j (factorized), while KL gradient dL_KL/ds_j couples all active neurons through d_logits/dh * dh/dm — a mathematical property of the gradient structure, not an analogy. This means KL captures joint interaction effects that BCE misses, especially at high sparsity.\n23\t\n24\t- **Headline result template**: \"On [benchmarks], a KL-trained predictor at 50% model-level sparsity achieves [X] quality (within [Y]% of dense) without compensation, while BCE+compensation achieves [Z] — demonstrating that output-distribution distillation subsumes error compensation and enabling a simpler, lighter inference pipeline.\"\n25\t\n26\t## Two-Dimensional Taxonomy (Conceptual Contribution)\n27\t\n28\t|                          | Decomposed (BCE) | Intermediate (MSE) | Coupled (KL) |\n29\t|--------------------------|:-----------------:|:-------------------:|:-------------:|\n30\t| Static                   | —                 | —                   | SPON          |\n31\t| Per-layer                | —                 | ShadowLLM           | —             |\n32\t| Per-token contextual     | FastForward       | —                   | **Ours**      |\n33\t\n34\tPositions prior work and ours on two axes: correction granularity (static -> per-token) x training signal coupling (decomposed/BCE -> coupled/KL). Highlights the empty cell we fill.\n35\t\n36\t## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns\n37\t\n38\t1. **\"Incremental / no new algorithm\"**: Mitigate with formal decomposition framework, quantitative s^2 prediction, and comprehensive four-quadrant outcome analysis showing all results are informative.\n39\t\n40\t2. **\"KL wins only because more compute\"**: Addressed by iso-compute ablation (plan_003) giving BCE equivalent total FLOPs via extended training.\n41\t\n42\t3. **\"Gumbel-sigmoid relaxation, not KL, explains gains\"**: Addressed by STE baseline (plan_002) isolating loss function contribution.\n43\t\n44\t4. **\"Single model / limited generalization\"**: Addressed by Mistral-7B-v0.3 validation (plan_009) with different architecture (GQA + sliding window).\n45\t\n46\t5. **\"Effect size may not hold on downstream tasks\"**: Full benchmark suite (PPL + 5 discriminative + LongBench + MT-Bench) covers all axes.\n47\t\n48\t## Venue Fit\n49\t- EMNLP Efficient Methods track: strong fit for activation sparsity + distillation\n50\t- NLP-specific evaluation (LongBench long-context, MT-Bench multi-turn) strengthens EMNLP fit vs pure systems venue\n51\t- Novelty ceiling acknowledged: contribution is systematic composition + rigorous ablation, not new architecture\n52\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e4efbda2-19e3-49b7-bacb-45a8e0db6a48","uuid":"926090bf-0e2c-4ecc-a7ef-0ccd2263ac85","timestamp":"2026-05-15T17:30:33.284Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_14/projects/distill_sparse_swiglu/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260515T164925/median/paper_framing.md","content":"# Paper Framing — distill_sparse_swiglu\n\n## Target Venue\n- Primary: EMNLP 2026 Main (ARR May 2026 cycle)\n- Deadline: 2026-05-25 (ARR submission)\n- Track: Efficient Methods for NLP\n\n## Core Claims\n\n1. **KL-trained sparsity predictors eliminate the need for error compensation networks**: At 50% model-level sparsity on SwiGLU LLMs, a KL-trained contextual predictor (no compensation) matches or exceeds BCE+compensation quality (FastForward-style), eliminating ~256MB of inference-time compensation weights and per-layer GEMV overhead. (Headline claim)\n\n2. **Static and contextual corrections compose additively**: SPON's input-independent bias correction (average-case drift) and KL-trained contextual prediction (per-input variation) provide additive quality recovery. Formalized as modular decomposition c = c_s + c_theta(x) where output-space interaction is negligible.\n\n3. **KL advantage scales quadratically with sparsity**: BCE's per-neuron factorized gradient (mean-field analog) misses joint neuron interactions scaling as O(s^2 D^2). Testable prediction: KL-vs-BCE delta follows approximately quadratic curve in sparsity level s.\n\n## Story Spine\n\n- **Problem**: SwiGLU activation sparsity enables 40-60% neuron pruning at inference, but training-free heuristics (WINA/TEAL) leave a 6+ point quality gap, while learned BCE predictors require auxiliary compensation networks adding ~256MB overhead (FastForward).\n\n- **Existing approaches & gaps**: (a) Training-free (WINA, TEAL, R-Sparse): no training cost, but quality gap too large for deployment. (b) Static learned (SPON): zero-overhead bias correction via KL distillation, but input-independent — cannot adapt to per-input neuron importance. (c) Contextual learned (FastForward): BCE predictor + compensation MLP, near-dense quality but inference overhead from compensation network. Gap: no prior work trains the contextual predictor itself with KL, and no work tests SPON + contextual composition.\n\n- **Our framing / headline question**: \"Does output-distribution distillation (KL) make error compensation unnecessary for contextual sparsity prediction?\" The theoretical grounding: BCE gradient dL_BCE/ds_j depends only on neuron j (factorized), while KL gradient dL_KL/ds_j couples all active neurons through d_logits/dh * dh/dm — a mathematical property of the gradient structure, not an analogy. This means KL captures joint interaction effects that BCE misses, especially at high sparsity.\n\n- **Headline result template**: \"On [benchmarks], a KL-trained predictor at 50% model-level sparsity achieves [X] quality (within [Y]% of dense) without compensation, while BCE+compensation achieves [Z] — demonstrating that output-distribution distillation subsumes error compensation and enabling a simpler, lighter inference pipeline.\"\n\n## Two-Dimensional Taxonomy (Conceptual Contribution)\n\n|                          | Decomposed (BCE) | Intermediate (MSE) | Coupled (KL) |\n|--------------------------|:-----------------:|:-------------------:|:-------------:|\n| Static                   | —                 | —                   | SPON          |\n| Per-layer                | —                 | ShadowLLM           | —             |\n| Per-token contextual     | FastForward       | —                   | **Ours**      |\n\nPositions prior work and ours on two axes: correction granularity (static -> per-token) x training signal coupling (decomposed/BCE -> coupled/KL). Highlights the empty cell we fill.\n\n## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns\n\n1. **\"Incremental / no new algorithm\"**: Mitigate with formal decomposition framework, quantitative s^2 prediction, and comprehensive four-quadrant outcome analysis showing all results are informative.\n\n2. **\"KL wins only because more compute\"**: Addressed by iso-compute ablation (plan_003) giving BCE equivalent total FLOPs via extended training.\n\n3. **\"Gumbel-sigmoid relaxation, not KL, explains gains\"**: Addressed by STE baseline (plan_002) isolating loss function contribution.\n\n4. **\"Single model / limited generalization\"**: Addressed by Mistral-7B-v0.3 validation (plan_009) with different architecture (GQA + sliding window).\n\n5. **\"Effect size may not hold on downstream tasks\"**: Full benchmark suite (PPL + 5 discriminative + LongBench + MT-Bench) covers all axes.\n\n## Venue Fit\n- EMNLP Efficient Methods track: strong fit for activation sparsity + distillation\n- NLP-specific evaluation (LongBench long-context, MT-Bench multi-turn) strengthens EMNLP fit vs pure systems venue\n- Novelty ceiling acknowledged: contribution is systematic composition + rigorous ablation, not new architecture\n","numLines":52,"startLine":1,"totalLines":52}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01KqaTEi6b4e4nmPBRTqiGtN","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"Four-condition ablation @ 50% sparsity\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"补充KL-only 2 seeds (s0, s1) 达到5-seed headline；新增BCE+comp 5 seeds； 新增KL+comp 3 seeds。与已有BCE-only 3 seeds和KL-only 3 seeds组合。\\n\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"kl_only_wikitext2_ppl_mean\": 9.53,\n7\t      \"kl_only_wikitext2_ppl_std\": 0.41,\n8\t      \"kl_only_wikitext2_ppl_seeds\": [\n9\t        9.21,\n10\t        9.25,\n11\t        9.14,\n12\t        9.85,\n13\t        10.18\n14\t      ],\n15\t      \"kl_only_model_sparsity\": 0.498,\n16\t      \"bce_only_wikitext2_ppl_mean\": 28.16,\n17\t      \"bce_only_wikitext2_ppl_std\": 0.21,\n18\t      \"bce_comp_wikitext2_ppl_mean\": 11.56,\n19\t      \"bce_comp_wikitext2_ppl_std\": 0.61,\n20\t      \"bce_comp_wikitext2_ppl_seeds\": [\n21\t        11.2,\n22\t        11.8,\n23\t        12.5,\n24\t        10.8,\n25\t        11.5\n26\t      ],\n27\t      \"bce_comp_param_overhead_mb\": 256,\n28\t      \"kl_comp_wikitext2_ppl_mean\": 9.05,\n29\t      \"kl_comp_wikitext2_ppl_std\": 0.15,\n30\t      \"kl_comp_wikitext2_ppl_seeds\": [\n31\t        9.05,\n32\t        9.2,\n33\t        8.9\n34\t      ],\n35\t      \"kl_only_vs_bce_comp_gap\": 2.03,\n36\t      \"kl_comp_vs_kl_only_improvement\": 0.48,\n37\t      \"dense_wikitext2_ppl\": 6.12\n38\t    },\n39\t    \"tables\": [\n40\t      {\n41\t        \"name\": \"Table 1: Four-condition ablation at 50% model-level sparsity (Llama 3.1 8B)\",\n42\t        \"columns\": [\n43\t          \"Condition\",\n44\t          \"WikiText-2 PPL (↓)\",\n45\t          \"Seeds\",\n46\t          \"Compensation Params\",\n47\t          \"Pipeline Complexity\"\n48\t        ],\n49\t        \"rows\": [\n50\t          [\n51\t            \"Dense (reference)\",\n52\t            \"6.12\",\n53\t            \"—\",\n54\t            \"—\",\n55\t            \"—\"\n56\t          ],\n57\t          [\n58\t            \"BCE-only\",\n59\t            \"28.16 ± 0.21\",\n60\t            3,\n61\t            0,\n62\t            \"Simple\"\n63\t          ],\n64\t          [\n65\t            \"BCE + compensation\",\n66\t            \"11.56 ± 0.61\",\n67\t            5,\n68\t            \"256 MB\",\n69\t            \"Complex\"\n70\t          ],\n71\t          [\n72\t            \"KL-only\",\n73\t            \"9.53 ± 0.41\",\n74\t            5,\n75\t            0,\n76\t            \"Simple\"\n77\t          ],\n78\t          [\n79\t            \"KL + compensation\",\n80\t            \"9.05 ± 0.15\",\n81\t            3,\n82\t            \"256 MB\",\n83\t            \"Complex\"\n84\t          ]\n85\t        ]\n86\t      }\n87\t    ],\n88\t    \"figures\": [],\n89\t    \"analysis\": \"Headline result支持revised Claim 1：KL-only在质量上优于BCE+comp (9.53 vs 11.56)， 同时完全省去compensation网络。KL+comp的微弱提升(0.48 PPL)表明compensation对KL是冗余的， 而对BCE是必需的(28.16→11.56)。这将论文核心message从\\\"KL is categorically better\\\" 调整为\\\"KL eliminates compensation overhead while achieving better quality\\\"—— 更nuanced但仍有明确的practical implication。 Seed方差增大(std 0.41)需要在paper中transparent报告，但5-seed mean的confidence interval 仍完全在BCE+comp之下。\\n\\n\\nKL-only: 新增s0/s1引入方差增大（s1=10.18为较弱种子），5-seed std从0.05升至0.41。 这反映Gumbel-sigmoid采样在不同初始化下的探索路径差异——部分种子的predictor在特定层学到次优mask分布， 导致几个层的neuron selection偏差累积。均值9.53仍在9.0-10.5范围内。\\nBCE+comp: compensation网络（per-layer MLP, ~256MB）有效修正BCE predictor的mask错误： BCE-only的per-neuron独立预测在高sparsity下产生大量joint interaction error， compensation网络通过residual connection学习修正sparse hidden state的drift。 PPL从28.16降至11.56，compensation确实有用（回收~16.6 PPL）。 但BCE的factorized gradient本身限制了mask质量ceiling，compensation只能修正而非预防错误。\\nKL+comp: compensation对KL的提升微弱（9.53→9.05, 仅0.48 PPL）。 因为KL loss通过d_logits/dh * dh/dm的gradient coupling已经在训练时优化了joint neuron selection， 留给compensation修正的residual error很小。这证明KL在训练阶段\\\"preempt\\\"了compensation需要解决的问题。\\n核心结论：KL-only (9.53) < BCE+comp (11.56)，且KL不需要256MB compensation overhead。 KL+comp的diminishing return进一步确认compensation对KL是冗余的。\\n\"\n90\t  },\n91\t  {\n92\t    \"name\": \"STE baseline: KL loss + Straight-Through Estimator\",\n93\t    \"description\": \"用STE替换Gumbel-sigmoid作为gradient estimator，保持KL loss不变。 3 seeds。隔离KL优势中loss function vs relaxation method的各自贡献。\\n\",\n94\t    \"results\": {\n95\t      \"kl_ste_wikitext2_ppl_mean\": 14.7,\n96\t      \"kl_ste_wikitext2_ppl_std\": 0.6,\n97\t      \"kl_ste_wikitext2_ppl_seeds\": [\n98\t        14.7,\n99\t        15.3,\n100\t        14.1\n101\t      ],\n102\t      \"kl_ste_model_sparsity\": 0.498,\n103\t      \"total_gain_over_bce\": 18.63,\n104\t      \"gain_from_kl_loss\": 13.46,\n105\t      \"gain_from_gumbel\": 5.17,\n106\t      \"gumbel_contribution_pct\": 27.8\n107\t    },\n108\t    \"tables\": [\n109\t      {\n110\t        \"name\": \"Table 2: Loss function vs relaxation method ablation\",\n111\t        \"columns\": [\n112\t          \"Condition\",\n113\t          \"Loss\",\n114\t          \"Relaxation\",\n115\t          \"WikiText-2 PPL\",\n116\t          \"Gain over BCE-only\"\n117\t        ],\n118\t        \"rows\": [\n119\t          [\n120\t            \"BCE-only\",\n121\t            \"BCE\",\n122\t            \"STE\",\n123\t            \"28.16\",\n124\t            \"—\"\n125\t          ],\n126\t          [\n127\t            \"KL + STE\",\n128\t            \"KL\",\n129\t            \"STE\",\n130\t            \"14.70 ± 0.60\",\n131\t            \"13.46 (72%)\"\n132\t          ],\n133\t          [\n134\t            \"KL + Gumbel\",\n135\t            \"KL\",\n136\t            \"Gumbel-σ\",\n137\t            \"9.53 ± 0.41\",\n138\t            \"18.63 (100%)\"\n139\t          ]\n140\t        ]\n141\t      }\n142\t    ],\n143\t    \"figures\": [],\n144\t    \"analysis\": \"KL loss贡献72%的improvement，Gumbel贡献28%。两者都是necessary component。 这回答reviewer concern #3: gains不是purely from Gumbel relaxation，KL loss本身是主要driver。 同时也表明gradient estimator的选择有meaningful impact，为future work （更好的relaxation methods）留下空间。\\n\\n\\nSTE将hard threshold的gradient设为1（identity），丢失了neuron importance的magnitude信息。 Gumbel-sigmoid在forward pass中通过temperature-controlled soft sampling保留了importance ranking的连续性， 使KL gradient能够区分\\\"barely active\\\"和\\\"strongly active\\\"的neurons。\\nKL+STE (14.70) 仍大幅优于BCE-only (28.16)，因为KL loss的joint coupling效应不依赖relaxation方法—— 即使用STE的biased gradient，KL的∂logits/∂mask仍传递了output-distribution level的supervision。 但STE的gradient bias导致predictor在边界neurons（importance接近threshold的neurons）上做出次优决策， 累积~5 PPL的损失。\\nGumbel贡献~28%的gain，说明\\\"loss和relaxation都重要\\\"——KL loss是主要贡献者（72%）， 但Gumbel的smooth gradient对于fine-grained mask optimization不可或缺。 这防御了reviewer concern \\\"Gumbel relaxation, not KL, explains gains\\\"。\\n\"\n145\t  },\n146\t  {\n147\t    \"name\": \"Iso-compute BCE comparison\",\n148\t    \"description\": \"扩展BCE训练步数以匹配KL的total FLOPs。KL需要per-step dense forward pass获取logits， BCE可用cached targets，因此BCE per-step成本远低于KL。等量计算下BCE可训练更多步。\\n\",\n149\t    \"results\": {\n150\t      \"kl_per_step_tflops\": 66.0,\n151\t      \"bce_per_step_tflops\": 0.8,\n152\t      \"kl_total_training_hours\": 3.8,\n153\t      \"bce_standard_training_hours\": 0.4,\n154\t      \"bce_isocompute_training_steps\": 33000,\n155\t      \"bce_isocompute_training_hours\": 3.8,\n156\t      \"bce_standard_ppl\": 28.16,\n157\t      \"bce_isocompute_ppl_mean\": 23.5,\n158\t      \"bce_isocompute_ppl_std\": 0.7,\n159\t      \"bce_isocompute_ppl_seeds\": [\n160\t        23.5,\n161\t        24.2,\n162\t        22.8\n163\t      ],\n164\t      \"kl_only_ppl_mean\": 9.53,\n165\t      \"gap_kl_vs_bce_isocompute\": 13.97\n166\t    },\n167\t    \"tables\": [\n168\t      {\n169\t        \"name\": \"Table 3: Iso-compute training comparison\",\n170\t        \"columns\": [\n171\t          \"Condition\",\n172\t          \"Per-step TFLOPs\",\n173\t          \"Total Steps\",\n174\t          \"GPU-hours\",\n175\t          \"WikiText-2 PPL\"\n176\t        ],\n177\t        \"rows\": [\n178\t          [\n179\t            \"KL + Gumbel\",\n180\t            66.0,\n181\t            1000,\n182\t            3.8,\n183\t            \"9.53 ± 0.41\"\n184\t          ],\n185\t          [\n186\t            \"BCE (standard)\",\n187\t            0.8,\n188\t            1000,\n189\t            0.4,\n190\t            \"28.16 ± 0.21\"\n191\t          ],\n192\t          [\n193\t            \"BCE (iso-compute)\",\n194\t            0.8,\n195\t            33000,\n196\t            3.8,\n197\t            \"23.50 ± 0.70\"\n198\t          ]\n199\t        ]\n200\t      }\n201\t    ],\n202\t    \"figures\": [],\n203\t    \"analysis\": \"直接回答reviewer concern #2 \\\"KL wins only because more compute\\\"。 等量计算下KL仍领先14 PPL points，BCE的per-neuron independence assumption是根本瓶颈。 附带发现：BCE training cost极低（0.4 vs 3.8 GPU-hours），在不追求最优质量的场景下 BCE+comp仍有实用价值（training便宜，compensation弥补质量），但KL在quality-critical场景下 是strictly better choice。\\n\\n\\nBCE per-step成本远低于KL（0.8 vs 66 TFLOPs），因为BCE只需predictor forward+binary target比对， 无需base model forward pass。等量计算下BCE获得~33x训练步数。\\n额外训练将BCE PPL从28.16降至23.50（降低16.5%）。改善来源： (1) predictor在更多数据上泛化更好，(2) 更充分的convergence。 但改善呈sharp diminishing returns——BCE在~5000步后已接近per-neuron prediction accuracy的ceiling。\\n即便给予等量计算，BCE (23.50) 仍比KL (9.53) 差14 PPL points。 这确认KL的优势不是compute artifact——BCE的factorized gradient （∂L/∂s_j仅依赖neuron j）无论训练多久都无法捕获joint neuron interactions。 Information bottleneck在loss function structure中，不在训练预算中。\\n\"\n204\t  },\n205\t  {\n206\t    \"name\": \"SPON reimplementation on Llama 3.1 8B\",\n207\t    \"description\": \"实现SPON（learnable per-layer bias vectors + KL training）。 先在5个QA benchmarks上验证可复现SPON发表结果，再用于composition实验。\\n\",\n208\t    \"results\": {\n209\t      \"spon_wikitext2_ppl\": 11.2,\n210\t      \"spon_ppl_increase_vs_dense_pct\": 83.0,\n211\t      \"spon_arc_c\": 49.5,\n212\t      \"spon_arc_e\": 75.8,\n213\t      \"spon_boolq\": 78.2,\n214\t      \"spon_piqa\": 77.5,\n215\t      \"spon_winogrande\": 69.8,\n216\t      \"reproduction_arc_c_delta_vs_published\": 1.2,\n217\t      \"reproduction_boolq_delta_vs_published\": 0.8,\n218\t      \"spon_training_hours\": 0.3,\n219\t      \"spon_param_count_mb\": 0.5,\n220\t      \"spon_inference_overhead_ms\": 0.0\n221\t    },\n222\t    \"tables\": [\n223\t      {\n224\t        \"name\": \"Table 4: SPON reproduction — QA benchmark comparison\",\n225\t        \"columns\": [\n226\t          \"Benchmark\",\n227\t          \"Dense\",\n228\t          \"SPON (ours)\",\n229\t          \"Δ vs published SPON\"\n230\t        ],\n231\t        \"rows\": [\n232\t          [\n233\t            \"ARC-c\",\n234\t            \"53.4%\",\n235\t            \"49.5%\",\n236\t            \"+1.2%\"\n237\t          ],\n238\t          [\n239\t            \"ARC-e\",\n240\t            \"81.2%\",\n241\t            \"75.8%\",\n242\t            \"-0.5%\"\n243\t          ],\n244\t          [\n245\t            \"BoolQ\",\n246\t            \"83.5%\",\n247\t            \"78.2%\",\n248\t            \"+0.8%\"\n249\t          ],\n250\t          [\n251\t            \"PIQA\",\n252\t            \"81.0%\",\n253\t            \"77.5%\",\n254\t            \"-1.0%\"\n255\t          ],\n256\t          [\n257\t            \"WinoGrande\",\n258\t            \"74.2%\",\n259\t            \"69.8%\",\n260\t            \"+0.6%\"\n261\t          ]\n262\t        ]\n263\t      }\n264\t    ],\n265\t    \"figures\": [],\n266\t    \"analysis\": \"SPON成功复现，PPL 11.20接近BCE+comp (11.56) 但zero overhead。 这为composition实验(plan_005)建立baseline。 有趣的observation：SPON (static KL-trained) ≈ BCE+comp (contextual BCE-trained)， 说明KL loss signal的quality甚至在static correction场景下也有value， 与BCE需要contextual compensation才能达到同等水平形成对比。\\n\\n\\nSPON的per-layer bias vector捕获average-case activation drift——当50%的neurons被pruned时， 每层hidden state的均值会systematically shift，bias correction直接补偿这个first-order偏差。 KL loss训练确保bias correction在output distribution level是optimal的（而非仅在hidden space level）。\\nPPL 11.20优于TEAL (~12.5)，因为static bias correction addresses the mean drift that magnitude-based pruning cannot handle。但远不如contextual KL (9.53)，因为 input-independent correction无法适应per-token的neuron importance variation—— 不同输入的optimal pruning pattern差异很大，static bias只是average correction。\\nQA benchmarks应在published results的±2%内，偏差来源： (1) Llama 3.1 8B vs SPON原文可能用不同base model，(2) sparsity target可能略有差异。 零inference overhead是SPON的关键优势——bias只是per-layer addition，fused into existing computation。\\n\"\n267\t  },\n268\t  {\n269\t    \"name\": \"SPON + KL predictor composition\",\n270\t    \"description\": \"同时应用SPON bias correction + KL contextual predictor。 Additivity test: 测量output-space interaction residual。Per-layer orthogonality分析。\\n\",\n271\t    \"results\": {\n272\t      \"spon_kl_wikitext2_ppl_mean\": 8.91,\n273\t      \"spon_kl_wikitext2_ppl_std\": 0.14,\n274\t      \"spon_kl_wikitext2_ppl_seeds\": [\n275\t        8.75,\n276\t        9.02,\n277\t        8.95\n278\t      ],\n279\t      \"spon_only_ppl\": 11.2,\n280\t      \"kl_only_ppl\": 9.53,\n281\t      \"interaction_residual_norm_ratio\": 0.22,\n282\t      \"per_layer_orthogonality_mean_cosine\": 0.18,\n283\t      \"hypothetical_fully_additive_ppl\": 8.23,\n284\t      \"actual_vs_additive_gap\": 0.68,\n285\t      \"interaction_residual_pct\": 22.0\n286\t    },\n287\t    \"tables\": [\n288\t      {\n289\t        \"name\": \"Table 5: Composition additivity analysis\",\n290\t        \"columns\": [\n291\t          \"Condition\",\n292\t          \"WikiText-2 PPL\",\n293\t          \"Δ from TEAL baseline\"\n294\t        ],\n295\t        \"rows\": [\n296\t          [\n297\t            \"TEAL (no learned correction)\",\n298\t            12.5,\n299\t            \"—\"\n300\t          ],\n301\t          [\n302\t            \"SPON only\",\n303\t            11.2,\n304\t            \"-1.30\"\n305\t          ],\n306\t          [\n307\t            \"KL-only\",\n308\t            9.53,\n309\t            \"-2.97\"\n310\t          ],\n311\t          [\n312\t            \"SPON + KL (if fully additive)\",\n313\t            8.23,\n314\t            \"-4.27\"\n315\t          ],\n316\t          [\n317\t            \"SPON + KL (actual)\",\n318\t            \"8.91 ± 0.14\",\n319\t            \"-3.59\"\n320\t          ],\n321\t          [\n322\t            \"Interaction residual\",\n323\t            \"—\",\n324\t            \"0.68 (22%)\"\n325\t          ]\n326\t        ]\n327\t      }\n328\t    ],\n329\t    \"figures\": [],\n330\t    \"analysis\": \"Composition有效但not clean：22% interaction residual意味着不能声称perfect additivity。 Claim 2需要弱化为\\\"empirically observed partial additivity\\\"。 Paper中需要supplementary analysis展示interaction term的per-layer breakdown， honest地characterize哪些层composition是near-additive的，哪些有significant overlap。 但SPON+KL (8.91) 作为best overall result仍然有value—— 证明static和contextual corrections可以有意义地组合，即使不是mathematically clean的。\\n\\n\\nSPON corrects average drift (first-order bias)，KL predictor adapts per-token neuron importance (conditional correction)。两者address partially orthogonal error sources： SPON修正\\\"平均而言哪些neurons被drop后hidden state往哪个方向drift\\\"， KL修正\\\"对这个specific input应该keep哪些neurons\\\"。\\nInteraction residual ~22%表明non-trivial overlap：KL predictor在训练时部分学到了 SPON负责的mean drift correction（因为KL loss本身会push predictor去修正所有可修正的error， 包括systematic bias）。因此组合收益存在但不perfectly additive。\\nPPL从KL-only (9.53) 提升到SPON+KL (8.91)，gain = 0.62 PPL。 如果fully additive（TEAL baseline 12.5为reference）： SPON improvement = 12.5 - 11.2 = 1.3, KL improvement = 12.5 - 9.53 = 2.97 Additive prediction: 12.5 - 1.3 - 2.97 = 8.23。Actual 8.91 vs 8.23 → 22% interaction residual。\\nOutput-space linearity test: ||Δ_logits(s+c) - Δ_logits(s) - Δ_logits(c)|| / ||Δ_logits(s+c)|| ≈ 0.22。 Per-layer分析：attention-heavy layers (early layers) 的correction更orthogonal (cosine ~0.1)， FFN-heavy layers (middle layers) 的overlap更大 (cosine ~0.25)。\\n\"\n331\t  },\n332\t  {\n333\t    \"name\": \"Training-free baselines @ 50% sparsity\",\n334\t    \"description\": \"TEAL (magnitude + greedy allocation), WINA (weight-informed scoring), R-Sparse (rank-aware scoring) 在Llama 3.1 8B上的controlled evaluation。\\n\",\n335\t    \"results\": {\n336\t      \"teal_wikitext2_ppl\": 12.5,\n337\t      \"teal_ppl_increase_vs_dense_pct\": 104.2,\n338\t      \"wina_wikitext2_ppl\": 14.2,\n339\t      \"wina_ppl_increase_vs_dense_pct\": 132.1,\n340\t      \"rsparse_wikitext2_ppl\": 13.5,\n341\t      \"rsparse_ppl_increase_vs_dense_pct\": 120.7,\n342\t      \"teal_training_hours\": 0,\n343\t      \"wina_training_hours\": 0,\n344\t      \"rsparse_training_hours\": 0\n345\t    },\n346\t    \"tables\": [\n347\t      {\n348\t        \"name\": \"Table 6: Training-free baselines at 50% model-level sparsity\",\n349\t        \"columns\": [\n350\t          \"Method\",\n351\t          \"WikiText-2 PPL\",\n352\t          \"Δ vs Dense\",\n353\t          \"Training Cost\"\n354\t        ],\n355\t        \"rows\": [\n356\t          [\n357\t            \"Dense\",\n358\t            6.12,\n359\t            \"—\",\n360\t            \"—\"\n361\t          ],\n362\t          [\n363\t            \"TEAL\",\n364\t            12.5,\n365\t            \"+6.38\",\n366\t            \"0\"\n367\t          ],\n368\t          [\n369\t            \"R-Sparse\",\n370\t            13.5,\n371\t            \"+7.38\",\n372\t            \"0\"\n373\t          ],\n374\t          [\n375\t            \"WINA\",\n376\t            14.2,\n377\t            \"+8.08\",\n378\t            \"0\"\n379\t          ],\n380\t          [\n381\t            \"KL-only (reference)\",\n382\t            9.53,\n383\t            \"+3.41\",\n384\t            \"3.8 h\"\n385\t          ]\n386\t        ]\n387\t      }\n388\t    ],\n389\t    \"figures\": [],\n390\t    \"analysis\": \"Training-free方法在50% sparsity下留下6-8 PPL gap，验证了paper framing中 \\\"training-free heuristics leave a 6+ point quality gap\\\"的claim。 TEAL是最强baseline (12.50)，将作为所有learned methods的primary comparison point。 三层hierarchy清晰：training-free (12.5-14.2) → static-learned/SPON (11.2) → contextual-learned/KL (9.5)。\\n\\n\\nTEAL最强：magnitude pruning + greedy per-layer allocation在SwiGLU上效果好， 因为gate activation magnitude直接反映neuron importance（gate值接近0的neuron贡献小）。 Greedy allocation在layers间智能分配sparsity budget（让important layers保留更多neurons）。\\nWINA次之（14.20）：weight-informed scoring考虑weight magnitude × activation， 但在50% high sparsity下，weight和activation的interaction是non-monotonic的 （large weight × small activation vs small weight × large activation的trade-off不清晰）， 导致pruning决策noisier。\\nR-Sparse居中（13.50）：rank-aware approach比pure magnitude好 （考虑了neurons之间的redundancy），但不如TEAL的greedy allocation adaptive。\\n三个training-free方法都比learned approaches差3-5 PPL以上， 确立了\\\"training-free < learned\\\"的hierarchy，justifying学习predictor的必要性。\\n\"\n391\t  },\n392\t  {\n393\t    \"name\": \"Full benchmark evaluation + wall-clock profiling\",\n394\t    \"description\": \"所有conditions在WikiText-2, C4, ARC-c, WinoGrande, MMLU, GSM8K, HumanEval上的完整评估。 Wall-clock latency profiling + memory overhead。Pareto frontier。\\n\",\n395\t    \"results\": {\n396\t      \"dense_wikitext2_ppl\": 6.12,\n397\t      \"dense_c4_ppl\": 8.88,\n398\t      \"dense_arc_c\": 53.4,\n399\t      \"dense_winogrande\": 74.2,\n400\t      \"dense_mmlu\": 65.3,\n401\t      \"dense_gsm8k\": 48.2,\n402\t      \"dense_humaneval\": 33.5,\n403\t      \"kl_only_wikitext2_ppl\": 9.53,\n404\t      \"kl_only_c4_ppl\": 12.8,\n405\t      \"kl_only_arc_c\": 51.5,\n406\t      \"kl_only_winogrande\": 72.0,\n407\t      \"kl_only_mmlu\": 63.0,\n408\t      \"kl_only_gsm8k\": 46.2,\n409\t      \"kl_only_humaneval\": 31.5,\n410\t      \"kl_only_avg_acc_drop_vs_dense_pct\": 3.4,\n411\t      \"bce_comp_wikitext2_ppl\": 11.56,\n412\t      \"bce_comp_c4_ppl\": 15.2,\n413\t      \"bce_comp_arc_c\": 50.2,\n414\t      \"bce_comp_winogrande\": 70.5,\n415\t      \"bce_comp_mmlu\": 61.8,\n416\t      \"bce_comp_gsm8k\": 44.8,\n417\t      \"bce_comp_humaneval\": 30.5,\n418\t      \"bce_comp_avg_acc_drop_vs_dense_pct\": 5.2,\n419\t      \"spon_kl_wikitext2_ppl\": 8.91,\n420\t      \"spon_kl_c4_ppl\": 11.9,\n421\t      \"spon_kl_arc_c\": 52.1,\n422\t      \"spon_kl_winogrande\": 72.8,\n423\t      \"spon_kl_mmlu\": 63.8,\n424\t      \"spon_kl_gsm8k\": 47.0,\n425\t      \"spon_kl_humaneval\": 32.0,\n426\t      \"spon_kl_avg_acc_drop_vs_dense_pct\": 2.3,\n427\t      \"teal_wikitext2_ppl\": 12.5,\n428\t      \"teal_arc_c\": 47.8,\n429\t      \"teal_mmlu\": 58.5,\n430\t      \"teal_avg_acc_drop_vs_dense_pct\": 9.8,\n431\t      \"dense_latency_ms_b1\": 18.0,\n432\t      \"kl_only_latency_ms_b1\": 16.5,\n433\t      \"bce_comp_latency_ms_b1\": 17.8,\n434\t      \"spon_kl_latency_ms_b1\": 16.5,\n435\t      \"kl_only_speedup_b1\": 1.09,\n436\t      \"bce_comp_speedup_b1\": 1.01,\n437\t      \"dense_latency_ms_b32\": 3.2,\n438\t      \"kl_only_latency_ms_b32\": 2.15,\n439\t      \"bce_comp_latency_ms_b32\": 2.72,\n440\t      \"spon_kl_latency_ms_b32\": 2.15,\n441\t      \"kl_only_speedup_b32\": 1.49,\n442\t      \"bce_comp_speedup_b32\": 1.18,\n443\t      \"kl_only_extra_params_mb\": 8,\n444\t      \"bce_comp_extra_params_mb\": 264,\n445\t      \"spon_kl_extra_params_mb\": 8.5\n446\t    },\n447\t    \"tables\": [\n448\t      {\n449\t        \"name\": \"Table 7: Full benchmark comparison (Llama 3.1 8B, 50% sparsity)\",\n450\t        \"columns\": [\n451\t          \"Method\",\n452\t          \"Wiki PPL↓\",\n453\t          \"C4 PPL↓\",\n454\t          \"ARC-c↑\",\n455\t          \"WG↑\",\n456\t          \"MMLU↑\",\n457\t          \"GSM8K↑\",\n458\t          \"HE↑\",\n459\t          \"Avg Acc Drop\"\n460\t        ],\n461\t        \"rows\": [\n462\t          [\n463\t            \"Dense\",\n464\t            6.12,\n465\t            8.88,\n466\t            53.4,\n467\t            74.2,\n468\t            65.3,\n469\t            48.2,\n470\t            33.5,\n471\t            \"—\"\n472\t          ],\n473\t          [\n474\t            \"TEAL\",\n475\t            12.5,\n476\t            17.1,\n477\t            47.8,\n478\t            67.2,\n479\t            58.5,\n480\t            40.5,\n481\t            27.0,\n482\t            \"9.8%\"\n483\t          ],\n484\t          [\n485\t            \"SPON\",\n486\t            11.2,\n487\t            15.5,\n488\t            49.5,\n489\t            69.8,\n490\t            60.5,\n491\t            43.0,\n492\t            28.5,\n493\t            \"7.0%\"\n494\t          ],\n495\t          [\n496\t            \"BCE+comp\",\n497\t            11.56,\n498\t            15.2,\n499\t            50.2,\n500\t            70.5,\n501\t            61.8,\n502\t            44.8,\n503\t            30.5,\n504\t            \"5.2%\"\n505\t          ],\n506\t          [\n507\t            \"KL-only\",\n508\t            9.53,\n509\t            12.8,\n510\t            51.5,\n511\t            72.0,\n512\t            63.0,\n513\t            46.2,\n514\t            31.5,\n515\t            \"3.4%\"\n516\t          ],\n517\t          [\n518\t            \"SPON+KL\",\n519\t            8.91,\n520\t            11.9,\n521\t            52.1,\n522\t            72.8,\n523\t            63.8,\n524\t            47.0,\n525\t            32.0,\n526\t            \"2.3%\"\n527\t          ]\n528\t        ]\n529\t      },\n530\t      {\n531\t        \"name\": \"Table 8: Inference efficiency (A100 GPU)\",\n532\t        \"columns\": [\n533\t          \"Method\",\n534\t          \"Latency b=1 (ms)\",\n535\t          \"Speedup b=1\",\n536\t          \"Latency b=32 (ms)\",\n537\t          \"Speedup b=32\",\n538\t          \"Extra Params\"\n539\t        ],\n540\t        \"rows\": [\n541\t          [\n542\t            \"Dense\",\n543\t            18.0,\n544\t            \"1.00×\",\n545\t            3.2,\n546\t            \"1.00×\",\n547\t            \"—\"\n548\t          ],\n549\t          [\n550\t            \"KL-only\",\n551\t            16.5,\n552\t            \"1.09×\",\n553\t            2.15,\n554\t            \"1.49×\",\n555\t            \"8 MB\"\n556\t          ],\n557\t          [\n558\t            \"SPON+KL\",\n559\t            16.5,\n560\t            \"1.09×\",\n561\t            2.15,\n562\t            \"1.49×\",\n563\t            \"8.5 MB\"\n564\t          ],\n565\t          [\n566\t            \"BCE+comp\",\n567\t            17.8,\n568\t            \"1.01×\",\n569\t            2.72,\n570\t            \"1.18×\",\n571\t            \"264 MB\"\n572\t          ]\n573\t        ]\n574\t      }\n575\t    ],\n576\t    \"figures\": [],\n577\t    \"analysis\": \"Main paper table确认KL-only在quality和efficiency两个维度上都dominate BCE+comp。 Quality: 9.53 vs 11.56 PPL, 3.4% vs 5.2% downstream drop。 Efficiency: 1.49x vs 1.18x at b=32, 8MB vs 264MB extra params。 SPON+KL是quality-optimal (8.91, 2.3% drop) 且efficiency与KL-only相同。 This is the paper's main result table, supporting the \\\"simpler pipeline, better quality\\\" narrative。\\n\\n\\nDownstream accuracy: KL-only的2-5% relative drop反映PPL degradation在discriminative tasks上的衰减： PPL从6.12升至9.53 (+56%)，但downstream accuracy仅降3.4%，因为discriminative tasks 主要依赖representation quality而非exact next-token prediction，而50% sparsity下 KL predictor保留了most important neurons，representation受损有限。\\nBCE+comp的downstream drop更大(5.2%)因为compensation网络修正的是hidden state drift而非 representation quality——补偿了数值偏差但未恢复pruning导致的information loss。\\nSPON+KL最佳(2.3% drop)因为static bias correction + contextual prediction覆盖了 both systematic和input-specific errors，leaving minimal residual representation damage。\\nLatency: batch=1时memory-bandwidth bound，sparsity的compute reduction被parameter loading开销稀释， KL仅1.09x speedup。Batch=32时compute-bound，50% FFN sparsity的savings充分显现： KL 1.49x vs BCE+comp 1.18x——compensation网络的256MB参数和per-layer GEMV 吃掉了batch场景下1/3的sparsity savings。这是KL的practical efficiency论点的核心。\\n\"\n578\t  },\n579\t  {\n580\t    \"name\": \"7-level sparsity sweep: KL vs BCE scaling\",\n581\t    \"description\": \"30/35/40/45/50/55/60% sparsity下KL-only vs BCE-only。 Test: KL-BCE PPL delta ~ s²。1 seed per level。50%复用plan_001数据。\\n\",\n582\t    \"results\": {\n583\t      \"sparsity_levels\": [\n584\t        0.3,\n585\t        0.35,\n586\t        0.4,\n587\t        0.45,\n588\t        0.5,\n589\t        0.55,\n590\t        0.6\n591\t      ],\n592\t      \"kl_only_ppls\": [\n593\t        6.82,\n594\t        7.28,\n595\t        7.95,\n596\t        8.58,\n597\t        9.53,\n598\t        11.2,\n599\t        14.05\n600\t      ],\n601\t      \"bce_only_ppls\": [\n602\t        11.32,\n603\t        14.48,\n604\t        18.95,\n605\t        23.38,\n606\t        28.16,\n607\t        36.7,\n608\t        49.05\n609\t      ],\n610\t      \"kl_bce_deltas\": [\n611\t        4.5,\n612\t        7.2,\n613\t        11.0,\n614\t        14.8,\n615\t        18.63,\n616\t        25.5,\n617\t        35.0\n618\t      ],\n619\t      \"quadratic_fit_a\": 97.2,\n620\t      \"quadratic_fit_r2\": 0.88,\n621\t      \"residual_at_030\": -2.17,\n622\t      \"residual_at_060\": 8.17\n623\t    },\n624\t    \"tables\": [\n625\t      {\n626\t        \"name\": \"Table 9: Sparsity sweep — KL vs BCE PPL\",\n627\t        \"columns\": [\n628\t          \"Sparsity\",\n629\t          \"KL PPL\",\n630\t          \"BCE PPL\",\n631\t          \"Δ(BCE-KL)\",\n632\t          \"Quadratic prediction\",\n633\t          \"Residual\"\n634\t        ],\n635\t        \"rows\": [\n636\t          [\n637\t            \"30%\",\n638\t            6.82,\n639\t            11.32,\n640\t            4.5,\n641\t            6.67,\n642\t            -2.17\n643\t          ],\n644\t          [\n645\t            \"35%\",\n646\t            7.28,\n647\t            14.48,\n648\t            7.2,\n649\t            9.07,\n650\t            -1.87\n651\t          ],\n652\t          [\n653\t            \"40%\",\n654\t            7.95,\n655\t            18.95,\n656\t            11.0,\n657\t            11.9,\n658\t            -0.9\n659\t          ],\n660\t          [\n661\t            \"45%\",\n662\t            8.58,\n663\t            23.38,\n664\t            14.8,\n665\t            15.08,\n666\t            -0.28\n667\t          ],\n668\t          [\n669\t            \"50%\",\n670\t            9.53,\n671\t            28.16,\n672\t            18.63,\n673\t            18.71,\n674\t            -0.08\n675\t          ],\n676\t          [\n677\t            \"55%\",\n678\t            11.2,\n679\t            36.7,\n680\t            25.5,\n681\t            22.79,\n682\t            2.71\n683\t          ],\n684\t          [\n685\t            \"60%\",\n686\t            14.05,\n687\t            49.05,\n688\t            35.0,\n689\t            27.31,\n690\t            7.69\n691\t          ]\n692\t        ]\n693\t      }\n694\t    ],\n695\t    \"figures\": [],\n696\t    \"analysis\": \"Claim 3降级为\\\"consistent empirical trend\\\"而非\\\"precise quadratic law\\\"。 R²=0.88表明quadratic model解释了88%的variance，但systematic residual pattern (low-s sub-quadratic, high-s super-quadratic) 表明真实关系比s²更complex。 在paper中放appendix展示完整fit，main text仅claim \\\"KL advantage grows super-linearly with sparsity, consistent with the theoretical prediction that joint interaction effects scale with the number of pruned neurons\\\"。\\n\\n\\nKL-BCE delta随sparsity单调递增：低sparsity时BCE的per-neuron独立假设damage较小 （pruning少量neurons时joint interaction effect有限），高sparsity时damage急剧增大 （每个pruning决策影响更多remaining neurons的joint output）。\\nQuadratic fit R²=0.88：存在clear上升趋势，但不是clean quadratic。 Deviation pattern: 低sparsity处delta低于quadratic prediction（此时neuron interactions是sparse的， BCE的independence assumption伤害有限）；高sparsity处delta高于quadratic prediction （此时interaction density超过O(s²)的简化模型，higher-order terms变得significant）。\\n这支持\\\"KL gradient captures joint interactions that scale with sparsity\\\"的intuition， 但fit noise和systematic residual pattern意味着precise s² law不成立。 R² 0.88在0.80-0.95范围内，支持\\\"consistent empirical trend\\\"但不支持\\\"precise quantitative law\\\"。\\n\"\n697\t  },\n698\t  {\n699\t    \"name\": \"Mistral-7B-v0.3 generalization validation\",\n700\t    \"description\": \"KL-only vs BCE+comp @ 50% sparsity on Mistral-7B-v0.3。 Core benchmarks: WikiText-2, ARC-c, MMLU。3 seeds each。\\n\",\n701\t    \"results\": {\n702\t      \"mistral_dense_wikitext2_ppl\": 5.52,\n703\t      \"mistral_kl_wikitext2_ppl_mean\": 9.38,\n704\t      \"mistral_kl_wikitext2_ppl_std\": 0.35,\n705\t      \"mistral_kl_wikitext2_ppl_seeds\": [\n706\t        9.15,\n707\t        9.35,\n708\t        9.65\n709\t      ],\n710\t      \"mistral_kl_ppl_increase_vs_dense_pct\": 69.9,\n711\t      \"mistral_kl_arc_c\": 52.8,\n712\t      \"mistral_kl_mmlu\": 61.5,\n713\t      \"mistral_bce_comp_wikitext2_ppl_mean\": 10.45,\n714\t      \"mistral_bce_comp_wikitext2_ppl_std\": 0.48,\n715\t      \"mistral_bce_comp_wikitext2_ppl_seeds\": [\n716\t        10.1,\n717\t        10.3,\n718\t        10.95\n719\t      ],\n720\t      \"mistral_bce_comp_ppl_increase_vs_dense_pct\": 89.3,\n721\t      \"mistral_bce_comp_arc_c\": 51.5,\n722\t      \"mistral_bce_comp_mmlu\": 60.2,\n723\t      \"mistral_kl_vs_bce_comp_gap\": 1.07,\n724\t      \"llama_kl_vs_bce_comp_gap\": 2.03\n725\t    },\n726\t    \"tables\": [\n727\t      {\n728\t        \"name\": \"Table 10: Cross-model validation (50% sparsity)\",\n729\t        \"columns\": [\n730\t          \"Model\",\n731\t          \"Condition\",\n732\t          \"Wiki PPL↓\",\n733\t          \"ARC-c↑\",\n734\t          \"MMLU↑\",\n735\t          \"KL-BCE gap\"\n736\t        ],\n737\t        \"rows\": [\n738\t          [\n739\t            \"Llama 3.1 8B\",\n740\t            \"Dense\",\n741\t            6.12,\n742\t            53.4,\n743\t            65.3,\n744\t            \"—\"\n745\t          ],\n746\t          [\n747\t            \"Llama 3.1 8B\",\n748\t            \"KL-only\",\n749\t            9.53,\n750\t            51.5,\n751\t            63.0,\n752\t            \"2.03\"\n753\t          ],\n754\t          [\n755\t            \"Llama 3.1 8B\",\n756\t            \"BCE+comp\",\n757\t            11.56,\n758\t            50.2,\n759\t            61.8,\n760\t            \"—\"\n761\t          ],\n762\t          [\n763\t            \"Mistral 7B v0.3\",\n764\t            \"Dense\",\n765\t            5.52,\n766\t            55.0,\n767\t            63.5,\n768\t            \"—\"\n769\t          ],\n770\t          [\n771\t            \"Mistral 7B v0.3\",\n772\t            \"KL-only\",\n773\t            9.38,\n774\t            52.8,\n775\t            61.5,\n776\t            \"1.07\"\n777\t          ],\n778\t          [\n779\t            \"Mistral 7B v0.3\",\n780\t            \"BCE+comp\",\n781\t            10.45,\n782\t            51.5,\n783\t            60.2,\n784\t            \"—\"\n785\t          ]\n786\t        ]\n787\t      }\n788\t    ],\n789\t    \"figures\": [],\n790\t    \"analysis\": \"回答reviewer concern #4 \\\"single model / limited generalization\\\"。 Mistral验证KL advantage的方向一致性，但smaller gap是honest finding—— 不同架构下advantage magnitude varies。Paper中报告为\\\"consistent across architectures\\\" 而非\\\"universal with fixed effect size\\\"。Mistral的GQA/sliding window解释 为gap缩小提供architectural intuition。\\n\\n\\nMistral同方向但relative gap更小 (1.07 vs Llama's 2.03 PPL)。原因： (1) Mistral的GQA (grouped-query attention) 产生更structured的activation pattern， SwiGLU层的neuron importance分布more concentrated (fewer \\\"ambiguous\\\" neurons near threshold)， 使得BCE的per-neuron独立预测在Mistral上less harmful。 (2) Mistral的sliding window attention导致信息更local，每个token的neuron importance 变化更平滑，减少了KL的contextual adaptation advantage。\\nKL PPL increase 70% vs dense (5.52→9.38) 在median tier的50-90%范围内。 BCE+comp PPL increase 89% (5.52→10.45) 表明compensation在Mistral上也有效。\\nGap缩小但方向一致：KL-only仍优于BCE+comp on all metrics， 证明KL advantage不是Llama-specific artifact，generalize across architectures。\\n\"\n791\t  },\n792\t  {\n793\t    \"name\": \"LongBench English subset evaluation (4K-32K tokens)\",\n794\t    \"description\": \"所有conditions在LongBench English subset上的评估： single-doc QA, multi-doc QA, summarization, few-shot, code。 测试predictor在超出训练序列长度时的generalization。\\n\",\n795\t    \"results\": {\n796\t      \"dense_single_doc_qa\": 42.5,\n797\t      \"dense_multi_doc_qa\": 36.0,\n798\t      \"dense_summarization\": 27.2,\n799\t      \"dense_few_shot\": 60.0,\n800\t      \"dense_code\": 34.0,\n801\t      \"dense_avg\": 39.9,\n802\t      \"kl_single_doc_qa\": 38.8,\n803\t      \"kl_multi_doc_qa\": 32.2,\n804\t      \"kl_summarization\": 25.5,\n805\t      \"kl_few_shot\": 55.8,\n806\t      \"kl_code\": 30.2,\n807\t      \"kl_avg\": 36.5,\n808\t      \"kl_avg_drop_pct\": 8.5,\n809\t      \"bce_comp_single_doc_qa\": 36.5,\n810\t      \"bce_comp_multi_doc_qa\": 30.0,\n811\t      \"bce_comp_summarization\": 24.2,\n812\t      \"bce_comp_few_shot\": 53.5,\n813\t      \"bce_comp_code\": 28.5,\n814\t      \"bce_comp_avg\": 34.5,\n815\t      \"bce_comp_avg_drop_pct\": 13.5,\n816\t      \"spon_kl_single_doc_qa\": 39.5,\n817\t      \"spon_kl_multi_doc_qa\": 33.0,\n818\t      \"spon_kl_summarization\": 25.8,\n819\t      \"spon_kl_few_shot\": 56.5,\n820\t      \"spon_kl_code\": 31.0,\n821\t      \"spon_kl_avg\": 37.2,\n822\t      \"spon_kl_avg_drop_pct\": 6.8,\n823\t      \"teal_avg\": 31.5,\n824\t      \"teal_avg_drop_pct\": 21.1\n825\t    },\n826\t    \"tables\": [\n827\t      {\n828\t        \"name\": \"Table 11: LongBench performance (English subset)\",\n829\t        \"columns\": [\n830\t          \"Method\",\n831\t          \"Single-doc QA\",\n832\t          \"Multi-doc QA\",\n833\t          \"Summ.\",\n834\t          \"Few-shot\",\n835\t          \"Code\",\n836\t          \"Avg\",\n837\t          \"Avg Drop\"\n838\t        ],\n839\t        \"rows\": [\n840\t          [\n841\t            \"Dense\",\n842\t            42.5,\n843\t            36.0,\n844\t            27.2,\n845\t            60.0,\n846\t            34.0,\n847\t            39.9,\n848\t            \"—\"\n849\t          ],\n850\t          [\n851\t            \"TEAL\",\n852\t            34.0,\n853\t            27.5,\n854\t            23.0,\n855\t            48.5,\n856\t            24.5,\n857\t            31.5,\n858\t            \"21.1%\"\n859\t          ],\n860\t          [\n861\t            \"BCE+comp\",\n862\t            36.5,\n863\t            30.0,\n864\t            24.2,\n865\t            53.5,\n866\t            28.5,\n867\t            34.5,\n868\t            \"13.5%\"\n869\t          ],\n870\t          [\n871\t            \"KL-only\",\n872\t            38.8,\n873\t            32.2,\n874\t            25.5,\n875\t            55.8,\n876\t            30.2,\n877\t            36.5,\n878\t            \"8.5%\"\n879\t          ],\n880\t          [\n881\t            \"SPON+KL\",\n882\t            39.5,\n883\t            33.0,\n884\t            25.8,\n885\t            56.5,\n886\t            31.0,\n887\t            37.2,\n888\t            \"6.8%\"\n889\t          ]\n890\t        ]\n891\t      }\n892\t    ],\n893\t    \"figures\": [],\n894\t    \"analysis\": \"Long-context generalization是KL approach的非trivial validation： predictor trained on short sequences仍在long context下保持8.5% average drop。 KL vs BCE+comp gap在long context下expand (8.5% vs 13.5%)，suggesting KL's distributional supervision provides better OOD robustness。 SPON+KL进一步improve (6.8%)，supporting the composition claim's practical value。\\n\\n\\nLong-context evaluation drop (KL avg 8.5%) 大于short-context downstream (3.4%)， 因为predictor在2048-token序列上训练，推广到4K-32K时neuron importance distribution shifts： 长文本中attention pattern更diffuse，neuron activation的long-range dependency增加， predictor需要在unseen的activation regime下做决策。\\nKL仍优于BCE+comp (8.5% vs 13.5% drop)：KL的output-distribution supervision在 distributional shift下更robust，因为即使在OOD inputs上，KL梯度仍push predictor 去最小化logit divergence，而BCE的target masks在OOD时可能fundamentally错误 （训练时的\\\"correct\\\" mask对长文本不适用）。\\nPer-task pattern: multi-doc QA和code drop最大（需要跨document/long-range reasoning， 对neuron selection错误最敏感）；summarization drop最小（更tolerant of approximate representation， 核心信息在early tokens中已被captured）。\\nSPON+KL最佳 (6.8% drop)：SPON的static bias correction在长文本中仍然valid （average drift不依赖sequence length），提供stable baseline correction。\\n\"\n895\t  },\n896\t  {\n897\t    \"name\": \"MT-Bench evaluation with GPT-4o judge\",\n898\t    \"description\": \"80 multi-turn questions, 8 categories。All conditions。 Tests instruction-following quality under sparsity。\\n\",\n899\t    \"results\": {\n900\t      \"dense_mt_bench_avg\": 7.25,\n901\t      \"kl_only_mt_bench_avg\": 6.72,\n902\t      \"bce_comp_mt_bench_avg\": 6.38,\n903\t      \"spon_kl_mt_bench_avg\": 6.85,\n904\t      \"teal_mt_bench_avg\": 5.8,\n905\t      \"kl_mt_writing\": 7.1,\n906\t      \"kl_mt_roleplay\": 6.9,\n907\t      \"kl_mt_reasoning\": 6.2,\n908\t      \"kl_mt_math\": 5.8,\n909\t      \"kl_mt_coding\": 6.5,\n910\t      \"kl_mt_extraction\": 7.3,\n911\t      \"kl_mt_stem\": 6.8,\n912\t      \"kl_mt_humanities\": 7.2\n913\t    },\n914\t    \"tables\": [\n915\t      {\n916\t        \"name\": \"Table 12: MT-Bench scores by category (GPT-4o judge)\",\n917\t        \"columns\": [\n918\t          \"Category\",\n919\t          \"Dense\",\n920\t          \"KL-only\",\n921\t          \"BCE+comp\",\n922\t          \"SPON+KL\"\n923\t        ],\n924\t        \"rows\": [\n925\t          [\n926\t            \"Writing\",\n927\t            7.5,\n928\t            7.1,\n929\t            6.8,\n930\t            7.2\n931\t          ],\n932\t          [\n933\t            \"Roleplay\",\n934\t            7.3,\n935\t            6.9,\n936\t            6.5,\n937\t            7.0\n938\t          ],\n939\t          [\n940\t            \"Reasoning\",\n941\t            6.8,\n942\t            6.2,\n943\t            5.8,\n944\t            6.4\n945\t          ],\n946\t          [\n947\t            \"Math\",\n948\t            6.5,\n949\t            5.8,\n950\t            5.3,\n951\t            6.0\n952\t          ],\n953\t          [\n954\t            \"Coding\",\n955\t            7.0,\n956\t            6.5,\n957\t            6.1,\n958\t            6.7\n959\t          ],\n960\t          [\n961\t            \"Extraction\",\n962\t            7.8,\n963\t            7.3,\n964\t            7.0,\n965\t            7.5\n966\t          ],\n967\t          [\n968\t            \"STEM\",\n969\t            7.2,\n970\t            6.8,\n971\t            6.4,\n972\t            6.9\n973\t          ],\n974\t          [\n975\t            \"Humanities\",\n976\t            7.9,\n977\t            7.2,\n978\t            7.2,\n979\t            7.3\n980\t          ],\n981\t          [\n982\t            \"Average\",\n983\t            7.25,\n984\t            6.72,\n985\t            6.38,\n986\t            6.85\n987\t          ]\n988\t        ]\n989\t      }\n990\t    ],\n991\t    \"figures\": [],\n992\t    \"analysis\": \"MT-Bench验证KL approach在instruction-following场景下的质量保持。 Average drop 0.53 for KL vs 0.87 for BCE+comp, consistent with PPL results。 Category-level breakdown provides actionable insight: math/reasoning是sparsity的weak spot， 可作为future work的optimization target。EMNLP reviewers重视NLP-specific evaluation， MT-Bench作为multi-turn generation quality metric补充了discriminative benchmarks。\\n\\n\\nMT-Bench average drop: KL -0.53, BCE+comp -0.87。Multi-turn instruction following 对model quality less sensitive than PPL would suggest：MT-Bench更多测试format compliance 和high-level reasoning，而非exact token probability。但math和reasoning categories 受sparsity影响最大（6.2, 5.8 for KL），因为这些需要precise computation chains where even small representation errors accumulate across reasoning steps。\\nWriting和extraction受影响最小（7.1, 7.3），因为这些依赖pattern matching和formatting rather than deep logical reasoning。\\nKL显著优于BCE+comp in multi-turn setting：multi-turn对话中error accumulation更严重， KL的lower per-step error导致multi-turn quality degradation更小。\\n\"\n993\t  },\n994\t  {\n995\t    \"name\": \"RULER synthetic long-context evaluation\",\n996\t    \"description\": \"RULER @ 4K和16K context，3 representative task types。 Fine-grained capability diagnostics complementing LongBench。\\n\",\n997\t    \"results\": {\n998\t      \"dense_ruler_4k_avg\": 92.0,\n999\t      \"kl_only_ruler_4k_avg\": 85.5,\n1000\t      \"bce_comp_ruler_4k_avg\": 81.0,\n1001\t      \"spon_kl_ruler_4k_avg\": 87.0,\n1002\t      \"dense_ruler_16k_avg\": 85.0,\n1003\t      \"kl_only_ruler_16k_avg\": 73.5,\n1004\t      \"bce_comp_ruler_16k_avg\": 67.0,\n1005\t      \"spon_kl_ruler_16k_avg\": 75.5,\n1006\t      \"kl_ruler_16k_needle_retrieval\": 78.0,\n1007\t      \"kl_ruler_16k_multi_key\": 70.5,\n1008\t      \"kl_ruler_16k_aggregation\": 72.0\n1009\t    },\n1010\t    \"tables\": [\n1011\t      {\n1012\t        \"name\": \"Table 13: RULER evaluation at 4K and 16K context\",\n1013\t        \"columns\": [\n1014\t          \"Method\",\n1015\t          \"4K Avg\",\n1016\t          \"16K Avg\",\n1017\t          \"4K→16K Δ\"\n1018\t        ],\n1019\t        \"rows\": [\n1020\t          [\n1021\t            \"Dense\",\n1022\t            92.0,\n1023\t            85.0,\n1024\t            \"-7.0\"\n1025\t          ],\n1026\t          [\n1027\t            \"KL-only\",\n1028\t            85.5,\n1029\t            73.5,\n1030\t            \"-12.0\"\n1031\t          ],\n1032\t          [\n1033\t            \"SPON+KL\",\n1034\t            87.0,\n1035\t            75.5,\n1036\t            \"-11.5\"\n1037\t          ],\n1038\t          [\n1039\t            \"BCE+comp\",\n1040\t            81.0,\n1041\t            67.0,\n1042\t            \"-14.0\"\n1043\t          ]\n1044\t        ]\n1045\t      }\n1046\t    ],\n1047\t    \"figures\": [],\n1048\t    \"analysis\": \"RULER确认LongBench的findings: KL在long context下更robust than BCE+comp， 且degradation rate (slope) 更小。作为appendix-level diagnostic complement LongBench的 naturalistic evaluation。4K→16K的degradation pattern suggest training on longer sequences could improve predictor robustness（future work direction）。\\n\\nRULER的synthetic tasks提供controlled diagnostics： 4K时KL drop 7% (85.5 vs 92.0)，与LongBench consistent但more controlled。 16K时KL drop增大到13.5% (73.5 vs 85.0)，表明predictor的generalization 随context length增加而degrade——在超出训练distribution的长context中， predictor对late-position tokens的neuron importance估计less accurate （attention pattern在long context中more diffuse，activation statistics shift）。\\nNeedle retrieval (78.0 at 16K) 相对较好因为retrieval主要依赖attention mechanism 而非FFN computation。Multi-key (70.5) 和aggregation (72.0) 更差因为 需要跨position的information integration，FFN computation的precision更重要。\\nBCE+comp在16K时drop更严重 (67.0, 21.2% drop)：compensation网络在OOD context下 不仅没帮助，反而可能introduce noise（compensation trained on short context的correction pattern在long context下不适用）。\\n\"\n1049\t  }\n1050\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e4efbda2-19e3-49b7-bacb-45a8e0db6a48","uuid":"ab1f0b6a-baf9-4110-a628-7375b55aa5d6","timestamp":"2026-05-15T17:30:33.322Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_14/projects/distill_sparse_swiglu/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260515T164925/median/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Four-condition ablation @ 50% sparsity\",\n    \"description\": \"补充KL-only 2 seeds (s0, s1) 达到5-seed headline；新增BCE+comp 5 seeds； 新增KL+comp 3 seeds。与已有BCE-only 3 seeds和KL-only 3 seeds组合。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"kl_only_wikitext2_ppl_mean\": 9.53,\n      \"kl_only_wikitext2_ppl_std\": 0.41,\n      \"kl_only_wikitext2_ppl_seeds\": [\n        9.21,\n        9.25,\n        9.14,\n        9.85,\n        10.18\n      ],\n      \"kl_only_model_sparsity\": 0.498,\n      \"bce_only_wikitext2_ppl_mean\": 28.16,\n      \"bce_only_wikitext2_ppl_std\": 0.21,\n      \"bce_comp_wikitext2_ppl_mean\": 11.56,\n      \"bce_comp_wikitext2_ppl_std\": 0.61,\n      \"bce_comp_wikitext2_ppl_seeds\": [\n        11.2,\n        11.8,\n        12.5,\n        10.8,\n        11.5\n      ],\n      \"bce_comp_param_overhead_mb\": 256,\n      \"kl_comp_wikitext2_ppl_mean\": 9.05,\n      \"kl_comp_wikitext2_ppl_std\": 0.15,\n      \"kl_comp_wikitext2_ppl_seeds\": [\n        9.05,\n        9.2,\n        8.9\n      ],\n      \"kl_only_vs_bce_comp_gap\": 2.03,\n      \"kl_comp_vs_kl_only_improvement\": 0.48,\n      \"dense_wikitext2_ppl\": 6.12\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 1: Four-condition ablation at 50% model-level sparsity (Llama 3.1 8B)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Condition\",\n          \"WikiText-2 PPL (↓)\",\n          \"Seeds\",\n          \"Compensation Params\",\n          \"Pipeline Complexity\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Dense (reference)\",\n            \"6.12\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"BCE-only\",\n            \"28.16 ± 0.21\",\n            3,\n            0,\n            \"Simple\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"BCE + compensation\",\n            \"11.56 ± 0.61\",\n            5,\n            \"256 MB\",\n            \"Complex\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"KL-only\",\n            \"9.53 ± 0.41\",\n            5,\n            0,\n            \"Simple\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"KL + compensation\",\n            \"9.05 ± 0.15\",\n            3,\n            \"256 MB\",\n            \"Complex\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Headline result支持revised Claim 1：KL-only在质量上优于BCE+comp (9.53 vs 11.56)， 同时完全省去compensation网络。KL+comp的微弱提升(0.48 PPL)表明compensation对KL是冗余的， 而对BCE是必需的(28.16→11.56)。这将论文核心message从\\\"KL is categorically better\\\" 调整为\\\"KL eliminates compensation overhead while achieving better quality\\\"—— 更nuanced但仍有明确的practical implication。 Seed方差增大(std 0.41)需要在paper中transparent报告，但5-seed mean的confidence interval 仍完全在BCE+comp之下。\\n\\n\\nKL-only: 新增s0/s1引入方差增大（s1=10.18为较弱种子），5-seed std从0.05升至0.41。 这反映Gumbel-sigmoid采样在不同初始化下的探索路径差异——部分种子的predictor在特定层学到次优mask分布， 导致几个层的neuron selection偏差累积。均值9.53仍在9.0-10.5范围内。\\nBCE+comp: compensation网络（per-layer MLP, ~256MB）有效修正BCE predictor的mask错误： BCE-only的per-neuron独立预测在高sparsity下产生大量joint interaction error， compensation网络通过residual connection学习修正sparse hidden state的drift。 PPL从28.16降至11.56，compensation确实有用（回收~16.6 PPL）。 但BCE的factorized gradient本身限制了mask质量ceiling，compensation只能修正而非预防错误。\\nKL+comp: compensation对KL的提升微弱（9.53→9.05, 仅0.48 PPL）。 因为KL loss通过d_logits/dh * dh/dm的gradient coupling已经在训练时优化了joint neuron selection， 留给compensation修正的residual error很小。这证明KL在训练阶段\\\"preempt\\\"了compensation需要解决的问题。\\n核心结论：KL-only (9.53) < BCE+comp (11.56)，且KL不需要256MB compensation overhead。 KL+comp的diminishing return进一步确认compensation对KL是冗余的。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"STE baseline: KL loss + Straight-Through Estimator\",\n    \"description\": \"用STE替换Gumbel-sigmoid作为gradient estimator，保持KL loss不变。 3 seeds。隔离KL优势中loss function vs relaxation method的各自贡献。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"kl_ste_wikitext2_ppl_mean\": 14.7,\n      \"kl_ste_wikitext2_ppl_std\": 0.6,\n      \"kl_ste_wikitext2_ppl_seeds\": [\n        14.7,\n        15.3,\n        14.1\n      ],\n      \"kl_ste_model_sparsity\": 0.498,\n      \"total_gain_over_bce\": 18.63,\n      \"gain_from_kl_loss\": 13.46,\n      \"gain_from_gumbel\": 5.17,\n      \"gumbel_contribution_pct\": 27.8\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 2: Loss function vs relaxation method ablation\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Condition\",\n          \"Loss\",\n          \"Relaxation\",\n          \"WikiText-2 PPL\",\n          \"Gain over BCE-only\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"BCE-only\",\n            \"BCE\",\n            \"STE\",\n            \"28.16\",\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"KL + STE\",\n            \"KL\",\n            \"STE\",\n            \"14.70 ± 0.60\",\n            \"13.46 (72%)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"KL + Gumbel\",\n            \"KL\",\n            \"Gumbel-σ\",\n            \"9.53 ± 0.41\",\n            \"18.63 (100%)\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"KL loss贡献72%的improvement，Gumbel贡献28%。两者都是necessary component。 这回答reviewer concern #3: gains不是purely from Gumbel relaxation，KL loss本身是主要driver。 同时也表明gradient estimator的选择有meaningful impact，为future work （更好的relaxation methods）留下空间。\\n\\n\\nSTE将hard threshold的gradient设为1（identity），丢失了neuron importance的magnitude信息。 Gumbel-sigmoid在forward pass中通过temperature-controlled soft sampling保留了importance ranking的连续性， 使KL gradient能够区分\\\"barely active\\\"和\\\"strongly active\\\"的neurons。\\nKL+STE (14.70) 仍大幅优于BCE-only (28.16)，因为KL loss的joint coupling效应不依赖relaxation方法—— 即使用STE的biased gradient，KL的∂logits/∂mask仍传递了output-distribution level的supervision。 但STE的gradient bias导致predictor在边界neurons（importance接近threshold的neurons）上做出次优决策， 累积~5 PPL的损失。\\nGumbel贡献~28%的gain，说明\\\"loss和relaxation都重要\\\"——KL loss是主要贡献者（72%）， 但Gumbel的smooth gradient对于fine-grained mask optimization不可或缺。 这防御了reviewer concern \\\"Gumbel relaxation, not KL, explains gains\\\"。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Iso-compute BCE comparison\",\n    \"description\": \"扩展BCE训练步数以匹配KL的total FLOPs。KL需要per-step dense forward pass获取logits， BCE可用cached targets，因此BCE per-step成本远低于KL。等量计算下BCE可训练更多步。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"kl_per_step_tflops\": 66.0,\n      \"bce_per_step_tflops\": 0.8,\n      \"kl_total_training_hours\": 3.8,\n      \"bce_standard_training_hours\": 0.4,\n      \"bce_isocompute_training_steps\": 33000,\n      \"bce_isocompute_training_hours\": 3.8,\n      \"bce_standard_ppl\": 28.16,\n      \"bce_isocompute_ppl_mean\": 23.5,\n      \"bce_isocompute_ppl_std\": 0.7,\n      \"bce_isocompute_ppl_seeds\": [\n        23.5,\n        24.2,\n        22.8\n      ],\n      \"kl_only_ppl_mean\": 9.53,\n      \"gap_kl_vs_bce_isocompute\": 13.97\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 3: Iso-compute training comparison\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Condition\",\n          \"Per-step TFLOPs\",\n          \"Total Steps\",\n          \"GPU-hours\",\n          \"WikiText-2 PPL\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"KL + Gumbel\",\n            66.0,\n            1000,\n            3.8,\n            \"9.53 ± 0.41\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"BCE (standard)\",\n            0.8,\n            1000,\n            0.4,\n            \"28.16 ± 0.21\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"BCE (iso-compute)\",\n            0.8,\n            33000,\n            3.8,\n            \"23.50 ± 0.70\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"直接回答reviewer concern #2 \\\"KL wins only because more compute\\\"。 等量计算下KL仍领先14 PPL points，BCE的per-neuron independence assumption是根本瓶颈。 附带发现：BCE training cost极低（0.4 vs 3.8 GPU-hours），在不追求最优质量的场景下 BCE+comp仍有实用价值（training便宜，compensation弥补质量），但KL在quality-critical场景下 是strictly better choice。\\n\\n\\nBCE per-step成本远低于KL（0.8 vs 66 TFLOPs），因为BCE只需predictor forward+binary target比对， 无需base model forward pass。等量计算下BCE获得~33x训练步数。\\n额外训练将BCE PPL从28.16降至23.50（降低16.5%）。改善来源： (1) predictor在更多数据上泛化更好，(2) 更充分的convergence。 但改善呈sharp diminishing returns——BCE在~5000步后已接近per-neuron prediction accuracy的ceiling。\\n即便给予等量计算，BCE (23.50) 仍比KL (9.53) 差14 PPL points。 这确认KL的优势不是compute artifact——BCE的factorized gradient （∂L/∂s_j仅依赖neuron j）无论训练多久都无法捕获joint neuron interactions。 Information bottleneck在loss function structure中，不在训练预算中。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"SPON reimplementation on Llama 3.1 8B\",\n    \"description\": \"实现SPON（learnable per-layer bias vectors + KL training）。 先在5个QA benchmarks上验证可复现SPON发表结果，再用于composition实验。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"spon_wikitext2_ppl\": 11.2,\n      \"spon_ppl_increase_vs_dense_pct\": 83.0,\n      \"spon_arc_c\": 49.5,\n      \"spon_arc_e\": 75.8,\n      \"spon_boolq\": 78.2,\n      \"spon_piqa\": 77.5,\n      \"spon_winogrande\": 69.8,\n      \"reproduction_arc_c_delta_vs_published\": 1.2,\n      \"reproduction_boolq_delta_vs_published\": 0.8,\n      \"spon_training_hours\": 0.3,\n      \"spon_param_count_mb\": 0.5,\n      \"spon_inference_overhead_ms\": 0.0\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 4: SPON reproduction — QA benchmark comparison\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Benchmark\",\n          \"Dense\",\n          \"SPON (ours)\",\n          \"Δ vs published SPON\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"ARC-c\",\n            \"53.4%\",\n            \"49.5%\",\n            \"+1.2%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"ARC-e\",\n            \"81.2%\",\n            \"75.8%\",\n            \"-0.5%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"BoolQ\",\n            \"83.5%\",\n            \"78.2%\",\n            \"+0.8%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"PIQA\",\n            \"81.0%\",\n            \"77.5%\",\n            \"-1.0%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"WinoGrande\",\n            \"74.2%\",\n            \"69.8%\",\n            \"+0.6%\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"SPON成功复现，PPL 11.20接近BCE+comp (11.56) 但zero overhead。 这为composition实验(plan_005)建立baseline。 有趣的observation：SPON (static KL-trained) ≈ BCE+comp (contextual BCE-trained)， 说明KL loss signal的quality甚至在static correction场景下也有value， 与BCE需要contextual compensation才能达到同等水平形成对比。\\n\\n\\nSPON的per-layer bias vector捕获average-case activation drift——当50%的neurons被pruned时， 每层hidden state的均值会systematically shift，bias correction直接补偿这个first-order偏差。 KL loss训练确保bias correction在output distribution level是optimal的（而非仅在hidden space level）。\\nPPL 11.20优于TEAL (~12.5)，因为static bias correction addresses the mean drift that magnitude-based pruning cannot handle。但远不如contextual KL (9.53)，因为 input-independent correction无法适应per-token的neuron importance variation—— 不同输入的optimal pruning pattern差异很大，static bias只是average correction。\\nQA benchmarks应在published results的±2%内，偏差来源： (1) Llama 3.1 8B vs SPON原文可能用不同base model，(2) sparsity target可能略有差异。 零inference overhead是SPON的关键优势——bias只是per-layer addition，fused into existing computation。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"SPON + KL predictor composition\",\n    \"description\": \"同时应用SPON bias correction + KL contextual predictor。 Additivity test: 测量output-space interaction residual。Per-layer orthogonality分析。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"spon_kl_wikitext2_ppl_mean\": 8.91,\n      \"spon_kl_wikitext2_ppl_std\": 0.14,\n      \"spon_kl_wikitext2_ppl_seeds\": [\n        8.75,\n        9.02,\n        8.95\n      ],\n      \"spon_only_ppl\": 11.2,\n      \"kl_only_ppl\": 9.53,\n      \"interaction_residual_norm_ratio\": 0.22,\n      \"per_layer_orthogonality_mean_cosine\": 0.18,\n      \"hypothetical_fully_additive_ppl\": 8.23,\n      \"actual_vs_additive_gap\": 0.68,\n      \"interaction_residual_pct\": 22.0\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 5: Composition additivity analysis\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Condition\",\n          \"WikiText-2 PPL\",\n          \"Δ from TEAL baseline\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"TEAL (no learned correction)\",\n            12.5,\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"SPON only\",\n            11.2,\n            \"-1.30\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"KL-only\",\n            9.53,\n            \"-2.97\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"SPON + KL (if fully additive)\",\n            8.23,\n            \"-4.27\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"SPON + KL (actual)\",\n            \"8.91 ± 0.14\",\n            \"-3.59\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Interaction residual\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"0.68 (22%)\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Composition有效但not clean：22% interaction residual意味着不能声称perfect additivity。 Claim 2需要弱化为\\\"empirically observed partial additivity\\\"。 Paper中需要supplementary analysis展示interaction term的per-layer breakdown， honest地characterize哪些层composition是near-additive的，哪些有significant overlap。 但SPON+KL (8.91) 作为best overall result仍然有value—— 证明static和contextual corrections可以有意义地组合，即使不是mathematically clean的。\\n\\n\\nSPON corrects average drift (first-order bias)，KL predictor adapts per-token neuron importance (conditional correction)。两者address partially orthogonal error sources： SPON修正\\\"平均而言哪些neurons被drop后hidden state往哪个方向drift\\\"， KL修正\\\"对这个specific input应该keep哪些neurons\\\"。\\nInteraction residual ~22%表明non-trivial overlap：KL predictor在训练时部分学到了 SPON负责的mean drift correction（因为KL loss本身会push predictor去修正所有可修正的error， 包括systematic bias）。因此组合收益存在但不perfectly additive。\\nPPL从KL-only (9.53) 提升到SPON+KL (8.91)，gain = 0.62 PPL。 如果fully additive（TEAL baseline 12.5为reference）： SPON improvement = 12.5 - 11.2 = 1.3, KL improvement = 12.5 - 9.53 = 2.97 Additive prediction: 12.5 - 1.3 - 2.97 = 8.23。Actual 8.91 vs 8.23 → 22% interaction residual。\\nOutput-space linearity test: ||Δ_logits(s+c) - Δ_logits(s) - Δ_logits(c)|| / ||Δ_logits(s+c)|| ≈ 0.22。 Per-layer分析：attention-heavy layers (early layers) 的correction更orthogonal (cosine ~0.1)， FFN-heavy layers (middle layers) 的overlap更大 (cosine ~0.25)。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Training-free baselines @ 50% sparsity\",\n    \"description\": \"TEAL (magnitude + greedy allocation), WINA (weight-informed scoring), R-Sparse (rank-aware scoring) 在Llama 3.1 8B上的controlled evaluation。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"teal_wikitext2_ppl\": 12.5,\n      \"teal_ppl_increase_vs_dense_pct\": 104.2,\n      \"wina_wikitext2_ppl\": 14.2,\n      \"wina_ppl_increase_vs_dense_pct\": 132.1,\n      \"rsparse_wikitext2_ppl\": 13.5,\n      \"rsparse_ppl_increase_vs_dense_pct\": 120.7,\n      \"teal_training_hours\": 0,\n      \"wina_training_hours\": 0,\n      \"rsparse_training_hours\": 0\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 6: Training-free baselines at 50% model-level sparsity\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Method\",\n          \"WikiText-2 PPL\",\n          \"Δ vs Dense\",\n          \"Training Cost\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Dense\",\n            6.12,\n            \"—\",\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"TEAL\",\n            12.5,\n            \"+6.38\",\n            \"0\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"R-Sparse\",\n            13.5,\n            \"+7.38\",\n            \"0\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"WINA\",\n            14.2,\n            \"+8.08\",\n            \"0\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"KL-only (reference)\",\n            9.53,\n            \"+3.41\",\n            \"3.8 h\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Training-free方法在50% sparsity下留下6-8 PPL gap，验证了paper framing中 \\\"training-free heuristics leave a 6+ point quality gap\\\"的claim。 TEAL是最强baseline (12.50)，将作为所有learned methods的primary comparison point。 三层hierarchy清晰：training-free (12.5-14.2) → static-learned/SPON (11.2) → contextual-learned/KL (9.5)。\\n\\n\\nTEAL最强：magnitude pruning + greedy per-layer allocation在SwiGLU上效果好， 因为gate activation magnitude直接反映neuron importance（gate值接近0的neuron贡献小）。 Greedy allocation在layers间智能分配sparsity budget（让important layers保留更多neurons）。\\nWINA次之（14.20）：weight-informed scoring考虑weight magnitude × activation， 但在50% high sparsity下，weight和activation的interaction是non-monotonic的 （large weight × small activation vs small weight × large activation的trade-off不清晰）， 导致pruning决策noisier。\\nR-Sparse居中（13.50）：rank-aware approach比pure magnitude好 （考虑了neurons之间的redundancy），但不如TEAL的greedy allocation adaptive。\\n三个training-free方法都比learned approaches差3-5 PPL以上， 确立了\\\"training-free < learned\\\"的hierarchy，justifying学习predictor的必要性。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Full benchmark evaluation + wall-clock profiling\",\n    \"description\": \"所有conditions在WikiText-2, C4, ARC-c, WinoGrande, MMLU, GSM8K, HumanEval上的完整评估。 Wall-clock latency profiling + memory overhead。Pareto frontier。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"dense_wikitext2_ppl\": 6.12,\n      \"dense_c4_ppl\": 8.88,\n      \"dense_arc_c\": 53.4,\n      \"dense_winogrande\": 74.2,\n      \"dense_mmlu\": 65.3,\n      \"dense_gsm8k\": 48.2,\n      \"dense_humaneval\": 33.5,\n      \"kl_only_wikitext2_ppl\": 9.53,\n      \"kl_only_c4_ppl\": 12.8,\n      \"kl_only_arc_c\": 51.5,\n      \"kl_only_winogrande\": 72.0,\n      \"kl_only_mmlu\": 63.0,\n      \"kl_only_gsm8k\": 46.2,\n      \"kl_only_humaneval\": 31.5,\n      \"kl_only_avg_acc_drop_vs_dense_pct\": 3.4,\n      \"bce_comp_wikitext2_ppl\": 11.56,\n      \"bce_comp_c4_ppl\": 15.2,\n      \"bce_comp_arc_c\": 50.2,\n      \"bce_comp_winogrande\": 70.5,\n      \"bce_comp_mmlu\": 61.8,\n      \"bce_comp_gsm8k\": 44.8,\n      \"bce_comp_humaneval\": 30.5,\n      \"bce_comp_avg_acc_drop_vs_dense_pct\": 5.2,\n      \"spon_kl_wikitext2_ppl\": 8.91,\n      \"spon_kl_c4_ppl\": 11.9,\n      \"spon_kl_arc_c\": 52.1,\n      \"spon_kl_winogrande\": 72.8,\n      \"spon_kl_mmlu\": 63.8,\n      \"spon_kl_gsm8k\": 47.0,\n      \"spon_kl_humaneval\": 32.0,\n      \"spon_kl_avg_acc_drop_vs_dense_pct\": 2.3,\n      \"teal_wikitext2_ppl\": 12.5,\n      \"teal_arc_c\": 47.8,\n      \"teal_mmlu\": 58.5,\n      \"teal_avg_acc_drop_vs_dense_pct\": 9.8,\n      \"dense_latency_ms_b1\": 18.0,\n      \"kl_only_latency_ms_b1\": 16.5,\n      \"bce_comp_latency_ms_b1\": 17.8,\n      \"spon_kl_latency_ms_b1\": 16.5,\n      \"kl_only_speedup_b1\": 1.09,\n      \"bce_comp_speedup_b1\": 1.01,\n      \"dense_latency_ms_b32\": 3.2,\n      \"kl_only_latency_ms_b32\": 2.15,\n      \"bce_comp_latency_ms_b32\": 2.72,\n      \"spon_kl_latency_ms_b32\": 2.15,\n      \"kl_only_speedup_b32\": 1.49,\n      \"bce_comp_speedup_b32\": 1.18,\n      \"kl_only_extra_params_mb\": 8,\n      \"bce_comp_extra_params_mb\": 264,\n      \"spon_kl_extra_params_mb\": 8.5\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 7: Full benchmark comparison (Llama 3.1 8B, 50% sparsity)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Method\",\n          \"Wiki PPL↓\",\n          \"C4 PPL↓\",\n          \"ARC-c↑\",\n          \"WG↑\",\n          \"MMLU↑\",\n          \"GSM8K↑\",\n          \"HE↑\",\n          \"Avg Acc Drop\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Dense\",\n            6.12,\n            8.88,\n            53.4,\n            74.2,\n            65.3,\n            48.2,\n            33.5,\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"TEAL\",\n            12.5,\n            17.1,\n            47.8,\n            67.2,\n            58.5,\n            40.5,\n            27.0,\n            \"9.8%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"SPON\",\n            11.2,\n            15.5,\n            49.5,\n            69.8,\n            60.5,\n            43.0,\n            28.5,\n            \"7.0%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"BCE+comp\",\n            11.56,\n            15.2,\n            50.2,\n            70.5,\n            61.8,\n            44.8,\n            30.5,\n            \"5.2%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"KL-only\",\n            9.53,\n            12.8,\n            51.5,\n            72.0,\n            63.0,\n            46.2,\n            31.5,\n            \"3.4%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"SPON+KL\",\n            8.91,\n            11.9,\n            52.1,\n            72.8,\n            63.8,\n            47.0,\n            32.0,\n            \"2.3%\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 8: Inference efficiency (A100 GPU)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Method\",\n          \"Latency b=1 (ms)\",\n          \"Speedup b=1\",\n          \"Latency b=32 (ms)\",\n          \"Speedup b=32\",\n          \"Extra Params\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Dense\",\n            18.0,\n            \"1.00×\",\n            3.2,\n            \"1.00×\",\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"KL-only\",\n            16.5,\n            \"1.09×\",\n            2.15,\n            \"1.49×\",\n            \"8 MB\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"SPON+KL\",\n            16.5,\n            \"1.09×\",\n            2.15,\n            \"1.49×\",\n            \"8.5 MB\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"BCE+comp\",\n            17.8,\n            \"1.01×\",\n            2.72,\n            \"1.18×\",\n            \"264 MB\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Main paper table确认KL-only在quality和efficiency两个维度上都dominate BCE+comp。 Quality: 9.53 vs 11.56 PPL, 3.4% vs 5.2% downstream drop。 Efficiency: 1.49x vs 1.18x at b=32, 8MB vs 264MB extra params。 SPON+KL是quality-optimal (8.91, 2.3% drop) 且efficiency与KL-only相同。 This is the paper's main result table, supporting the \\\"simpler pipeline, better quality\\\" narrative。\\n\\n\\nDownstream accuracy: KL-only的2-5% relative drop反映PPL degradation在discriminative tasks上的衰减： PPL从6.12升至9.53 (+56%)，但downstream accuracy仅降3.4%，因为discriminative tasks 主要依赖representation quality而非exact next-token prediction，而50% sparsity下 KL predictor保留了most important neurons，representation受损有限。\\nBCE+comp的downstream drop更大(5.2%)因为compensation网络修正的是hidden state drift而非 representation quality——补偿了数值偏差但未恢复pruning导致的information loss。\\nSPON+KL最佳(2.3% drop)因为static bias correction + contextual prediction覆盖了 both systematic和input-specific errors，leaving minimal residual representation damage。\\nLatency: batch=1时memory-bandwidth bound，sparsity的compute reduction被parameter loading开销稀释， KL仅1.09x speedup。Batch=32时compute-bound，50% FFN sparsity的savings充分显现： KL 1.49x vs BCE+comp 1.18x——compensation网络的256MB参数和per-layer GEMV 吃掉了batch场景下1/3的sparsity savings。这是KL的practical efficiency论点的核心。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"7-level sparsity sweep: KL vs BCE scaling\",\n    \"description\": \"30/35/40/45/50/55/60% sparsity下KL-only vs BCE-only。 Test: KL-BCE PPL delta ~ s²。1 seed per level。50%复用plan_001数据。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"sparsity_levels\": [\n        0.3,\n        0.35,\n        0.4,\n        0.45,\n        0.5,\n        0.55,\n        0.6\n      ],\n      \"kl_only_ppls\": [\n        6.82,\n        7.28,\n        7.95,\n        8.58,\n        9.53,\n        11.2,\n        14.05\n      ],\n      \"bce_only_ppls\": [\n        11.32,\n        14.48,\n        18.95,\n        23.38,\n        28.16,\n        36.7,\n        49.05\n      ],\n      \"kl_bce_deltas\": [\n        4.5,\n        7.2,\n        11.0,\n        14.8,\n        18.63,\n        25.5,\n        35.0\n      ],\n      \"quadratic_fit_a\": 97.2,\n      \"quadratic_fit_r2\": 0.88,\n      \"residual_at_030\": -2.17,\n      \"residual_at_060\": 8.17\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 9: Sparsity sweep — KL vs BCE PPL\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Sparsity\",\n          \"KL PPL\",\n          \"BCE PPL\",\n          \"Δ(BCE-KL)\",\n          \"Quadratic prediction\",\n          \"Residual\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"30%\",\n            6.82,\n            11.32,\n            4.5,\n            6.67,\n            -2.17\n          ],\n          [\n            \"35%\",\n            7.28,\n            14.48,\n            7.2,\n            9.07,\n            -1.87\n          ],\n          [\n            \"40%\",\n            7.95,\n            18.95,\n            11.0,\n            11.9,\n            -0.9\n          ],\n          [\n            \"45%\",\n            8.58,\n            23.38,\n            14.8,\n            15.08,\n            -0.28\n          ],\n          [\n            \"50%\",\n            9.53,\n            28.16,\n            18.63,\n            18.71,\n            -0.08\n          ],\n          [\n            \"55%\",\n            11.2,\n            36.7,\n            25.5,\n            22.79,\n            2.71\n          ],\n          [\n            \"60%\",\n            14.05,\n            49.05,\n            35.0,\n            27.31,\n            7.69\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Claim 3降级为\\\"consistent empirical trend\\\"而非\\\"precise quadratic law\\\"。 R²=0.88表明quadratic model解释了88%的variance，但systematic residual pattern (low-s sub-quadratic, high-s super-quadratic) 表明真实关系比s²更complex。 在paper中放appendix展示完整fit，main text仅claim \\\"KL advantage grows super-linearly with sparsity, consistent with the theoretical prediction that joint interaction effects scale with the number of pruned neurons\\\"。\\n\\n\\nKL-BCE delta随sparsity单调递增：低sparsity时BCE的per-neuron独立假设damage较小 （pruning少量neurons时joint interaction effect有限），高sparsity时damage急剧增大 （每个pruning决策影响更多remaining neurons的joint output）。\\nQuadratic fit R²=0.88：存在clear上升趋势，但不是clean quadratic。 Deviation pattern: 低sparsity处delta低于quadratic prediction（此时neuron interactions是sparse的， BCE的independence assumption伤害有限）；高sparsity处delta高于quadratic prediction （此时interaction density超过O(s²)的简化模型，higher-order terms变得significant）。\\n这支持\\\"KL gradient captures joint interactions that scale with sparsity\\\"的intuition， 但fit noise和systematic residual pattern意味着precise s² law不成立。 R² 0.88在0.80-0.95范围内，支持\\\"consistent empirical trend\\\"但不支持\\\"precise quantitative law\\\"。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Mistral-7B-v0.3 generalization validation\",\n    \"description\": \"KL-only vs BCE+comp @ 50% sparsity on Mistral-7B-v0.3。 Core benchmarks: WikiText-2, ARC-c, MMLU。3 seeds each。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"mistral_dense_wikitext2_ppl\": 5.52,\n      \"mistral_kl_wikitext2_ppl_mean\": 9.38,\n      \"mistral_kl_wikitext2_ppl_std\": 0.35,\n      \"mistral_kl_wikitext2_ppl_seeds\": [\n        9.15,\n        9.35,\n        9.65\n      ],\n      \"mistral_kl_ppl_increase_vs_dense_pct\": 69.9,\n      \"mistral_kl_arc_c\": 52.8,\n      \"mistral_kl_mmlu\": 61.5,\n      \"mistral_bce_comp_wikitext2_ppl_mean\": 10.45,\n      \"mistral_bce_comp_wikitext2_ppl_std\": 0.48,\n      \"mistral_bce_comp_wikitext2_ppl_seeds\": [\n        10.1,\n        10.3,\n        10.95\n      ],\n      \"mistral_bce_comp_ppl_increase_vs_dense_pct\": 89.3,\n      \"mistral_bce_comp_arc_c\": 51.5,\n      \"mistral_bce_comp_mmlu\": 60.2,\n      \"mistral_kl_vs_bce_comp_gap\": 1.07,\n      \"llama_kl_vs_bce_comp_gap\": 2.03\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 10: Cross-model validation (50% sparsity)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Model\",\n          \"Condition\",\n          \"Wiki PPL↓\",\n          \"ARC-c↑\",\n          \"MMLU↑\",\n          \"KL-BCE gap\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Llama 3.1 8B\",\n            \"Dense\",\n            6.12,\n            53.4,\n            65.3,\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Llama 3.1 8B\",\n            \"KL-only\",\n            9.53,\n            51.5,\n            63.0,\n            \"2.03\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Llama 3.1 8B\",\n            \"BCE+comp\",\n            11.56,\n            50.2,\n            61.8,\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Mistral 7B v0.3\",\n            \"Dense\",\n            5.52,\n            55.0,\n            63.5,\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Mistral 7B v0.3\",\n            \"KL-only\",\n            9.38,\n            52.8,\n            61.5,\n            \"1.07\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Mistral 7B v0.3\",\n            \"BCE+comp\",\n            10.45,\n            51.5,\n            60.2,\n            \"—\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"回答reviewer concern #4 \\\"single model / limited generalization\\\"。 Mistral验证KL advantage的方向一致性，但smaller gap是honest finding—— 不同架构下advantage magnitude varies。Paper中报告为\\\"consistent across architectures\\\" 而非\\\"universal with fixed effect size\\\"。Mistral的GQA/sliding window解释 为gap缩小提供architectural intuition。\\n\\n\\nMistral同方向但relative gap更小 (1.07 vs Llama's 2.03 PPL)。原因： (1) Mistral的GQA (grouped-query attention) 产生更structured的activation pattern， SwiGLU层的neuron importance分布more concentrated (fewer \\\"ambiguous\\\" neurons near threshold)， 使得BCE的per-neuron独立预测在Mistral上less harmful。 (2) Mistral的sliding window attention导致信息更local，每个token的neuron importance 变化更平滑，减少了KL的contextual adaptation advantage。\\nKL PPL increase 70% vs dense (5.52→9.38) 在median tier的50-90%范围内。 BCE+comp PPL increase 89% (5.52→10.45) 表明compensation在Mistral上也有效。\\nGap缩小但方向一致：KL-only仍优于BCE+comp on all metrics， 证明KL advantage不是Llama-specific artifact，generalize across architectures。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"LongBench English subset evaluation (4K-32K tokens)\",\n    \"description\": \"所有conditions在LongBench English subset上的评估： single-doc QA, multi-doc QA, summarization, few-shot, code。 测试predictor在超出训练序列长度时的generalization。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"dense_single_doc_qa\": 42.5,\n      \"dense_multi_doc_qa\": 36.0,\n      \"dense_summarization\": 27.2,\n      \"dense_few_shot\": 60.0,\n      \"dense_code\": 34.0,\n      \"dense_avg\": 39.9,\n      \"kl_single_doc_qa\": 38.8,\n      \"kl_multi_doc_qa\": 32.2,\n      \"kl_summarization\": 25.5,\n      \"kl_few_shot\": 55.8,\n      \"kl_code\": 30.2,\n      \"kl_avg\": 36.5,\n      \"kl_avg_drop_pct\": 8.5,\n      \"bce_comp_single_doc_qa\": 36.5,\n      \"bce_comp_multi_doc_qa\": 30.0,\n      \"bce_comp_summarization\": 24.2,\n      \"bce_comp_few_shot\": 53.5,\n      \"bce_comp_code\": 28.5,\n      \"bce_comp_avg\": 34.5,\n      \"bce_comp_avg_drop_pct\": 13.5,\n      \"spon_kl_single_doc_qa\": 39.5,\n      \"spon_kl_multi_doc_qa\": 33.0,\n      \"spon_kl_summarization\": 25.8,\n      \"spon_kl_few_shot\": 56.5,\n      \"spon_kl_code\": 31.0,\n      \"spon_kl_avg\": 37.2,\n      \"spon_kl_avg_drop_pct\": 6.8,\n      \"teal_avg\": 31.5,\n      \"teal_avg_drop_pct\": 21.1\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 11: LongBench performance (English subset)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Method\",\n          \"Single-doc QA\",\n          \"Multi-doc QA\",\n          \"Summ.\",\n          \"Few-shot\",\n          \"Code\",\n          \"Avg\",\n          \"Avg Drop\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Dense\",\n            42.5,\n            36.0,\n            27.2,\n            60.0,\n            34.0,\n            39.9,\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"TEAL\",\n            34.0,\n            27.5,\n            23.0,\n            48.5,\n            24.5,\n            31.5,\n            \"21.1%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"BCE+comp\",\n            36.5,\n            30.0,\n            24.2,\n            53.5,\n            28.5,\n            34.5,\n            \"13.5%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"KL-only\",\n            38.8,\n            32.2,\n            25.5,\n            55.8,\n            30.2,\n            36.5,\n            \"8.5%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"SPON+KL\",\n            39.5,\n            33.0,\n            25.8,\n            56.5,\n            31.0,\n            37.2,\n            \"6.8%\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Long-context generalization是KL approach的非trivial validation： predictor trained on short sequences仍在long context下保持8.5% average drop。 KL vs BCE+comp gap在long context下expand (8.5% vs 13.5%)，suggesting KL's distributional supervision provides better OOD robustness。 SPON+KL进一步improve (6.8%)，supporting the composition claim's practical value。\\n\\n\\nLong-context evaluation drop (KL avg 8.5%) 大于short-context downstream (3.4%)， 因为predictor在2048-token序列上训练，推广到4K-32K时neuron importance distribution shifts： 长文本中attention pattern更diffuse，neuron activation的long-range dependency增加， predictor需要在unseen的activation regime下做决策。\\nKL仍优于BCE+comp (8.5% vs 13.5% drop)：KL的output-distribution supervision在 distributional shift下更robust，因为即使在OOD inputs上，KL梯度仍push predictor 去最小化logit divergence，而BCE的target masks在OOD时可能fundamentally错误 （训练时的\\\"correct\\\" mask对长文本不适用）。\\nPer-task pattern: multi-doc QA和code drop最大（需要跨document/long-range reasoning， 对neuron selection错误最敏感）；summarization drop最小（更tolerant of approximate representation， 核心信息在early tokens中已被captured）。\\nSPON+KL最佳 (6.8% drop)：SPON的static bias correction在长文本中仍然valid （average drift不依赖sequence length），提供stable baseline correction。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"MT-Bench evaluation with GPT-4o judge\",\n    \"description\": \"80 multi-turn questions, 8 categories。All conditions。 Tests instruction-following quality under sparsity。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"dense_mt_bench_avg\": 7.25,\n      \"kl_only_mt_bench_avg\": 6.72,\n      \"bce_comp_mt_bench_avg\": 6.38,\n      \"spon_kl_mt_bench_avg\": 6.85,\n      \"teal_mt_bench_avg\": 5.8,\n      \"kl_mt_writing\": 7.1,\n      \"kl_mt_roleplay\": 6.9,\n      \"kl_mt_reasoning\": 6.2,\n      \"kl_mt_math\": 5.8,\n      \"kl_mt_coding\": 6.5,\n      \"kl_mt_extraction\": 7.3,\n      \"kl_mt_stem\": 6.8,\n      \"kl_mt_humanities\": 7.2\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 12: MT-Bench scores by category (GPT-4o judge)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Category\",\n          \"Dense\",\n          \"KL-only\",\n          \"BCE+comp\",\n          \"SPON+KL\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Writing\",\n            7.5,\n            7.1,\n            6.8,\n            7.2\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Roleplay\",\n            7.3,\n            6.9,\n            6.5,\n            7.0\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Reasoning\",\n            6.8,\n            6.2,\n            5.8,\n            6.4\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Math\",\n            6.5,\n            5.8,\n            5.3,\n            6.0\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Coding\",\n            7.0,\n            6.5,\n            6.1,\n            6.7\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Extraction\",\n            7.8,\n            7.3,\n            7.0,\n            7.5\n          ],\n          [\n            \"STEM\",\n            7.2,\n            6.8,\n            6.4,\n            6.9\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Humanities\",\n            7.9,\n            7.2,\n            7.2,\n            7.3\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Average\",\n            7.25,\n            6.72,\n            6.38,\n            6.85\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"MT-Bench验证KL approach在instruction-following场景下的质量保持。 Average drop 0.53 for KL vs 0.87 for BCE+comp, consistent with PPL results。 Category-level breakdown provides actionable insight: math/reasoning是sparsity的weak spot， 可作为future work的optimization target。EMNLP reviewers重视NLP-specific evaluation， MT-Bench作为multi-turn generation quality metric补充了discriminative benchmarks。\\n\\n\\nMT-Bench average drop: KL -0.53, BCE+comp -0.87。Multi-turn instruction following 对model quality less sensitive than PPL would suggest：MT-Bench更多测试format compliance 和high-level reasoning，而非exact token probability。但math和reasoning categories 受sparsity影响最大（6.2, 5.8 for KL），因为这些需要precise computation chains where even small representation errors accumulate across reasoning steps。\\nWriting和extraction受影响最小（7.1, 7.3），因为这些依赖pattern matching和formatting rather than deep logical reasoning。\\nKL显著优于BCE+comp in multi-turn setting：multi-turn对话中error accumulation更严重， KL的lower per-step error导致multi-turn quality degradation更小。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"RULER synthetic long-context evaluation\",\n    \"description\": \"RULER @ 4K和16K context，3 representative task types。 Fine-grained capability diagnostics complementing LongBench。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"dense_ruler_4k_avg\": 92.0,\n      \"kl_only_ruler_4k_avg\": 85.5,\n      \"bce_comp_ruler_4k_avg\": 81.0,\n      \"spon_kl_ruler_4k_avg\": 87.0,\n      \"dense_ruler_16k_avg\": 85.0,\n      \"kl_only_ruler_16k_avg\": 73.5,\n      \"bce_comp_ruler_16k_avg\": 67.0,\n      \"spon_kl_ruler_16k_avg\": 75.5,\n      \"kl_ruler_16k_needle_retrieval\": 78.0,\n      \"kl_ruler_16k_multi_key\": 70.5,\n      \"kl_ruler_16k_aggregation\": 72.0\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 13: RULER evaluation at 4K and 16K context\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Method\",\n          \"4K Avg\",\n          \"16K Avg\",\n          \"4K→16K Δ\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Dense\",\n            92.0,\n            85.0,\n            \"-7.0\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"KL-only\",\n            85.5,\n            73.5,\n            \"-12.0\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"SPON+KL\",\n            87.0,\n            75.5,\n            \"-11.5\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"BCE+comp\",\n            81.0,\n            67.0,\n            \"-14.0\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"RULER确认LongBench的findings: KL在long context下更robust than BCE+comp， 且degradation rate (slope) 更小。作为appendix-level diagnostic complement LongBench的 naturalistic evaluation。4K→16K的degradation pattern suggest training on longer sequences could improve predictor robustness（future work direction）。\\n\\nRULER的synthetic tasks提供controlled diagnostics： 4K时KL drop 7% (85.5 vs 92.0)，与LongBench consistent但more controlled。 16K时KL drop增大到13.5% (73.5 vs 85.0)，表明predictor的generalization 随context length增加而degrade——在超出训练distribution的长context中， predictor对late-position tokens的neuron importance估计less accurate （attention pattern在long context中more diffuse，activation statistics shift）。\\nNeedle retrieval (78.0 at 16K) 相对较好因为retrieval主要依赖attention mechanism 而非FFN computation。Multi-key (70.5) 和aggregation (72.0) 更差因为 需要跨position的information integration，FFN computation的precision更重要。\\nBCE+comp在16K时drop更严重 (67.0, 21.2% drop)：compensation网络在OOD context下 不仅没帮助，反而可能introduce noise（compensation trained on short context的correction pattern在long context下不适用）。\\n\"\n  }\n]","numLines":1050,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1050}}}
